          "uuid": "10f3abfe-3172-44e8-ac61-4a50c571e0fe",
          "body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 437,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-28T11:35:38.236Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T11:38:04.695Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Upcat\",\n      \"slug\": \"upcat\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"HUMAN-RESOURCES\",\n        \"COPYWRITING\",\n        \"WRITING-GENERATORS\",\n        \"COVER-LETTER-GENERATOR\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>UpCat is a browser extension designed to assist Upwork users in creating high-quality cover letters efficiently, tailored to specific job positions, while also providing job alerts for new postings.</p>\\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Expert-Level Cover Letters:</strong>&nbsp;Utilizes ChatGPT integration to generate customized cover letters with minimal keystrokes, ensuring superior quality tailored to each job application.</li>\\n<li><strong>New Job Opening Alerts:</strong>&nbsp;Includes an alert feature that notifies users of new job postings, enabling them to apply promptly and increase their chances of being hired.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Time and Effort Savings:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Allows users to create polished cover letters within minutes, saving time and effort that can be redirected to other job search activities like networking or researching potential employers.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>Increased Employment Likelihood:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Enhances the likelihood of being hired by providing high-quality cover letters, which play a crucial role in securing interview invitations and leaving a favorable impression on potential employers.</li>\\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": null,\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": null,\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/CsVigatL1yM\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul>\\n<li>Organizations of Every Scale: Saving time and resources, SwagAI streamlines the swag administration process for both large corporations and small startups.</li>\\n<li>Marketing experts: Optimal for marketing groups in search of novel approaches to foster consumer engagement, increase brand allegiance, and enhance digital visibility.</li>\\n<li>Simplify the process of selecting and distributing swag for corporate events, trade fairs, and conferences.</li>\\n<li>Managers of HR: In order to bolster employee morale and satisfaction, incorporate personalized and one-of-a-kind gifting merchandise into employee recognition initiatives and company gatherings.</li>\\n</ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://upcat.app/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://upcat.app/assets/upcat-logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": null,\n      \"categories\": null,\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 435,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-28T08:43:21.553Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": null,\n      \"date_updated\": null,\n      \"title\": \"SwagAI\",\n      \"slug\": \"swag-ai\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"HUMAN-RESOURCES\",\n        \"COPYWRITING\",\n        \"WRITING-GENERATORS\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>SwagAI is an AI application designed to simplify the process of creating custom company apparel by offering unconventional yet feasible alternatives tailored to brand identity.</p>\\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Brand-Centric Experience:</strong>&nbsp;Ensures every aspect, from packaging to inserts, reflects the unique identity of the brand, prioritizing brand prominence.</li>\\n<li><strong>Global Operations Management:</strong>&nbsp;Manages manufacturing, storage, and shipping worldwide, along with customer service, vendor relations, and customs correspondence.</li>\\n<li><strong>Tailored Call-to-Action:</strong>&nbsp;Allows customization of giveaways with distinct call-to-action strategies to engage target audiences, such as gaining followers or increasing sales.</li>\\n<li><strong>Closet Purging Service:</strong>&nbsp;Offers the option to incorporate existing merchandise into swag giveaways, enabling the reclaiming of workspace and efficient utilization of resources.</li>\\n<li><strong>Quality Merchandise:</strong> Collaborates with reputable suppliers to provide high-value swag appreciated by customers or employees.</li>\\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": null,\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": null,\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul>\\n<li>Organizations of Every Scale: Saving time and resources, SwagAI streamlines the swag administration process for both large corporations and small startups.</li>\\n<li>Marketing experts: Optimal for marketing groups in search of novel approaches to foster consumer engagement, increase brand allegiance, and enhance digital visibility.</li>\\n<li>Simplify the process of selecting and distributing swag for corporate events, trade fairs, and conferences.</li>\\n<li>Managers of HR: In order to bolster employee morale and satisfaction, incorporate personalized and one-of-a-kind gifting merchandise into employee recognition initiatives and company gatherings.</li>\\n</ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.useslingshot.com/swagai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/useslingshot/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/useslingshot\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://www.useslingshot.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Gold-Logo-Text.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"hr\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 249,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.639Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.941Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Zaplingo\",\n      \"slug\": \"Zaplingo\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Audio\",\n        \"Speaking skills\",\n        \"Improve grammar\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Zaplingo is a WhatsApp-based English tutor driven by artificial intelligence, offering students a supportive environment to practice and improve their English speaking skills. With audio communications, practical exercises, and clear grammar explanations, it aims to boost learners&#39; confidence and language proficiency.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Audio Conversations:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Engage in practical conversation exercises through audio messaging.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Grammar Explanations:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Receive clear and concise explanations of grammar to understand language rules effectively.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>24/7 Accessibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Learn at any time, offering flexibility and convenience for learners&#39; schedules.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Native Language Assistance:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Seek clarifications in your mother tongue to aid comprehension.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Free Usage:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Access all benefits and features of the tool at no cost.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Zaplingo is an AI-driven WhatsApp English tutor, providing practical conversation exercises, clear grammar explanations, 24/7 accessibility, native language assistance, and free usage for learners.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Individuals who are interested in honing and developing their proficiency in the English language. Speak more effectively while receiving immediate feedback.</li><li>Those who are seeking a supportive and low-pressure setting in which to improve their language skills.</li><li>Individuals who favor the ease and availability of acquiring knowledge via WhatsApp.</li><li>English language learners who desire explanations of grammar and opportunities to practice real-life conversations.</li><li>Individuals seeking an accessible and cost-effective English tutoring alternative.</li><li>Utilizing the capabilities of artificial intelligence and integrating it with WhatsApp, Zaplingo offers students a convenient and efficient method to improve their English language proficiency.</li><li>Clarifications of standards regarding grammar can help. Conquer shyness in an atmosphere of minimal pressure.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://zaplingo.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"audio_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 248,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.638Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T11:11:37.731Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Mathly\",\n      \"slug\": \"mathly\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Students\",\n        \"Practice-problems\",\n        \"Solve-math\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Mathly is an AI-driven application designed to assist students with their mathematical assignments. It provides explanations, solutions, and practice problems tailored to the user&#39;s learning style, enhancing comprehension and efficiency in math learning.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Photo-based Problem Resolution:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Capture images of math problems to receive answers and logical explanations from the AI.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Individualized Explanations:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Receive explanations customized to the user&#39;s learning style.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Query Response:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Obtain responses to any inquiries related to mathematical problems.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Generation of Analogous Problems:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Receive similar problems to solve along with explanations, aiding in understanding.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Efficient Learning:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Mathly offers a streamlined approach to studying, maximizing productivity and effectiveness.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Mathly is an AI-powered tool for math assignments, offering photo-based problem resolution, individualized explanations, comprehensive query response, generation of analogous problems, and efficient learning methods.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Assisting pupils with their mathematical assignments</li><li>Offering tailored explanations to enhance comprehension</li><li>Responding to inquiries pertaining to mathematical problems</li><li>Solving analogous problems to facilitate practice and enhance comprehension</li><li>Offering an efficient and effective method for learning mathematics</li><li>Obtain detailed solutions to mathematical problems.</li><li>Produce follow-up inquiries and practice problems in order to assess comprehension.</li><li>Adapt explanations to the learning approach of the user.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://mathly.webflow.io/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 247,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.636Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T11:13:52.715Z\",\n      \"title\": \"PromptFolder\",\n      \"slug\": \"PromptFolder\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Ai Chatbots\",\n        \"Writing Generators\",\n        \"SEO\",\n        \"Social Media\",\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Prompt Generators\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>PromptFolder is an innovative AI prompt administration application developed to streamline the workflow of engaging with AI language models like ChatGPT and Midjourney. It offers a centralized platform for generating, organizing, and storing prompts, enhancing efficiency and productivity.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Prompt Categorization:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Organize AI prompts into containers for efficient retrieval and reuse.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Direct Integration with ChatGPT:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Establish seamless integration with ChatGPT via a user-friendly Chrome browser extension.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Advanced Editor:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Refine prompt quality using an advanced editing tool to optimize AI output.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Curated Compilation of Trending Prompts:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Access trending prompts for inspiration or as foundational entries for your own creations.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Enhanced Organization:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Categorizes prompts systematically for easy access.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Efficiency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Rapidly locate and repurpose prompts, reducing the need for retyping or remembering complex inputs.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Intuitive Interface:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Streamlines interaction with AI models with its user-friendly interface.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Community-Driven Insights:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Benefit from prompts proven effective by fellow users, fostering collaboration.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Internet Connection Dependency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Optimal functionality relies on a stable internet connection.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Learning Curve:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Novice users may require time to familiarize themselves with advanced features.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Chrome Extension Exclusivity:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Currently limited to Chrome users, potentially excluding users of alternative browsers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"PromptFolder streamlines AI prompt management for users, offering categorization, integration with ChatGPT, advanced editing, and access to trending prompts, enhancing efficiency and collaboration.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Facilitating the workflow of content creators in the generation of writing prompts and ideas.</li><li>Organization of keyword prompts for AI-assisted content creation by SEO specialists.</li><li>Social Media Managers: Prompts for generating engaging posts are saved and categorized.</li><li>Scholars: Maintaining a record of diverse inquiry prompts utilized in scholarly or commercial investigations.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: educators integrating prompts into classroom AI demonstrations; podcasters employing them to determine show topics.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://promptfolder.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/ColeSouth\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://static.promptfolder.com/static/img/logo.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 246,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.635Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.937Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Emdash\",\n      \"slug\": \"Emdash\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Students\",\n        \"Library\",\n        \"Book Highlights\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Emdash is an AI-driven application designed to aid users in recalling and learning from their reading materials by organizing and consolidating highlights from ebooks and articles. With a user-friendly interface and compatibility across various literary genres, Emphasize is valuable for avid readers, students, and researchers seeking efficient organization and retrieval of book highlights.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Consolidation of Key Points:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Objective is to organize and arrange key points extracted from publications and articles.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Efficient Data Retrieval:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Assists users in retaining and extracting knowledge from their reading material effectively.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Genre Compatibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Suitable for philosophical, non-fiction, and novelistic works, catering to diverse reading preferences.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Capacity Management:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Capable of efficiently handling a substantial quantity of books and their associated highlights.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Emdash is an AI-driven tool that organizes and consolidates book highlights, aiding users in efficient data retrieval and learning from their reading materials across various genres.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Assist hard-core readers, scholars, and researchers in effectively retrieving and retaining book highlights.</li><li>Enhance learning and retention of information across a range of literary genres.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://emdash.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://emdash.ai/images/logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 245,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.633Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.936Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Prompt Refine\",\n      \"slug\": \"Prompt-Refine\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Prompt Generators\",\n        \"Writing Generators\",\n        \"Copywriting\",\n        \"Marketing\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Prompt Refine is an advanced AI application designed to enhance and accelerate the content creation process. It leverages cutting-edge AI technology to ensure the production of high-quality content efficiently, catering to the needs of writers, marketers, and professionals seeking writing assistance.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Sophisticated AI Technology:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Utilizes machine learning algorithms to generate logical and superior-quality content.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers an intuitive design for seamless content production.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Individualized Prompts:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows users to customize prompts according to specific requirements, ensuring the creation of relevant and valuable content.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Superior Quality Content:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Engineered to produce exceptional content that aligns with the user&#39;s desired tone, style, and context.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Efficiency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Optimizes content creation, saving significant time and effort for users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Quality Assurance:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Ensures content meets high-quality standards and user expectations.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Flexibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enables personalization of prompts, enhancing adaptability to various content creation needs.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Easy navigation and usage, suitable for both experienced and novice users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Language Limitation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Currently supports only the English language.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Internet Dependency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Functionality relies on internet connectivity, which may pose challenges in regions with poor internet access.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Prompt Refine is an AI-driven tool facilitating efficient and high-quality content creation, featuring personalized prompts and a user-friendly interface. While optimizing the content generation process, it supports flexibility but is presently limited to English and requires internet access for operation.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Content writers employ the tool to efficiently generate concepts and draft articles.</li><li>Marketers: Developing compelling content for marketing campaigns using the tool.</li><li>Bloggers: Developing superior blog posts by utilizing the instrument.</li><li>Students: Applying the instrument to compose academic papers.</li><li>Employed by non-native English speakers to enhance their writing proficiency; utilized by programmers to generate code comments.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.promptrefine.com/subscribe\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.promptrefine.com/prompt/new\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/promptrefine\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 244,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.632Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.935Z\",\n      \"title\": \"IMAGINaiTION\",\n      \"slug\": \"IMAGINaiTION\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Fun Tools\",\n        \"Storyteller\",\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Writing\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>IMAGINaiTION AI is an application designed to generate customized bedtime and brief stories for children, utilizing dynamic AI technology. It aims to enhance cognitive development, foster creativity, and strengthen parent-child bonds.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Individualized Narratives:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Tailors stories based on the unique interests and preferences of each child.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Character Development:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows users to create characters by selecting attributes, qualities, and disposition.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Plot Development:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides the option to craft a captivating narrative arc or rely on AI-generated plots.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Scene Setting:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers a variety of settings, from futuristic cities to enchanted forests.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Enchantment Enhancement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enables personalization of narratives with sidekicks, magical elements, or unexpected developments.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"IMAGINaiTION AI is an application powered by dynamic AI technology, crafting personalized bedtime and brief stories for children. It offers customizable narratives, character and plot development options, diverse scene settings, and enchantment enhancements to foster creativity and cognitive development in children.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Primarily intended for parents with children no older than five years.</li><li>Beyond this age range, it may also serve as a useful tool for children with neurodivergent abilities.</li><li>Content that is adaptable to the various developmental phases of children.</li><li>Children's literacy and creativity are enhanced.</li><li>Parent-child intimacy is enhanced via interactive storytelling.</li><li>Provides children with countless stories to discover.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://imaginaition.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://instagram.com/imaginaition.ai?igshid=ZDdkNTZiNTM=\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://imaginaition.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/logo-imaginaition-768x151.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 243,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.631Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.933Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Video Candy\",\n      \"slug\": \"Video-Candy\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Video Editing\",\n        \"Video Enhancer\",\n        \"Text To Video\",\n        \"Marketing\",\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Audio Editing\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Video Candy is a comprehensive digital video editing platform powered by artificial intelligence, catering to the needs of diverse users such as marketing experts and content creators. It aims to streamline and enhance the video editing process for users of all skill levels.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Intuitive Video Editor:</strong><ul> \\n<li>User-friendly interface simplifies the editing process.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>More Than Forty Tools:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers various features including video compression, trimming, and merging.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Screen Recorder:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows users to record screen activity for multiple purposes.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Audio Manipulation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Modify video pace, insert music, and remove audio from videos.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Quality Export:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Ensures videos are exported with consistent high quality.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Watermark-Free Videos:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Paid plans enable watermark-free video creation for a professional appearance.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>High Priority Processing:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Accelerates video processing to reduce waiting time.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>No File Size Limitation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows uploads of videos with 100% file size, facilitating storage of larger projects.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Versatile Editing Tools:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers a suite of highly versatile editing tools to meet various editing needs.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negative:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Time Limit on Processing:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Processing time limit of 20 minutes despite high priority.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Paid Plan Requirement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Subscription needed to access all features.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Learning Curve:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Novice users may experience a prolonged learning curve due to the extensive range of features.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Video Candy, an AI-powered video editing platform, offers intuitive editing tools, more than forty features, screen recording, audio manipulation, and quality export options. It provides watermark-free videos, high-priority processing, unlimited file size uploads, but requires a subscription for full access, and may have a learning curve for beginners.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/0-t2J1GiW98\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Content creators employ the platform to generate captivating content for a multitude of social media platforms.</li><li>Experts in marketing create persuasive video advertisements and promotional materials.</li><li>Educators: applying multimedia elements to the development of educational content and presentations.</li><li>Entrepreneurs of small businesses: Developing video content to enhance brand recognition and establish an online presence.</li><li>Unusual Application Cases: Employed by nonprofit entities to promote awareness; embraced by individuals for personal video endeavors.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://videocandy.com/pricing.html\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://videocandy.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://static.videocandy.com/images/Video_Candy_Full_Logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"video_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 242,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.629Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.932Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Monic Ai\",\n      \"slug\": \"Monic-Ai\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Monic.ai is an AI-powered learning tool designed to enhance the learning experience by providing interactivity, effectiveness, and enjoyment.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Multilingual Support:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Supports over 60 languages, ensuring accessibility for users globally.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Adaptable Learning Functionality:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Acts as a learning companion, assisting users in creating assessments, flashcards, summaries, and study guides swiftly.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>AI Analysis and Customization:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes AI models to analyze uploaded materials and generate personalized learning resources tailored to individual user requirements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Effortless Material Upload:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Allows users to easily upload various materials such as files, texts, YouTube video links, and documents by simply dragging and dropping them onto the platform.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Comprehensive Learning Techniques:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a range of learning techniques including spaced repetition and simulated exams to ensure effective information retention.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Positive User Feedback:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Garnered commendation from thousands of learners for efficiency, user-friendliness, extensive resource collection, and automated flashcard system.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Professional Application:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Beneficial for professionals to enhance their expertise through valuable resources and simulated assessments.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Tailored Learning Experience:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates the uploading of materials in various formats to produce individualized resources catering to specific learning requirements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Continuous Growth Platform:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers ongoing development through sophisticated learning methods like spaced repetition and interactive simulated assessments.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Is Monic.ai capable of adjusting to my learning style and the various subjects I am researching?<br>Without a doubt, Monic.ai's adaptability enables it to accommodate diverse learning approaches and support a wide range of subjects. It facilitates the creation of interactive exams and summaries of learning materials, enabling users to tailor their learning experience to their specific study requirements, preferences, areas of proficiency, and areas for improvement.<br>What is the potential of Monic.ai?<br>Users have the ability to upload learning materials of various formats and lengths (including but not limited to articles, videos, images, and text). Subsequently, these materials can be converted into a lengthy summary, a few paragraphs, or a bullet point list of sentences with a single click using the summarizer tool. This facilitates the reading experience by directing attention towards the key arguments that hold significance.How is the quality of its study materials and assessments maintained on Monic.ai?<br>Specifically designed for educational content, Monic.ai constructed the most advanced AI model in the industry to curate and improve assessments and study materials, ensuring they adhere to the most stringent quality and educational value criteria. Irrespective of the quiz creator or summary generator you utilize, you can be certain that the quality will consistently represent the pinnacle of AI capability.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Monic.ai is an AI-driven learning tool offering multilingual support, adaptable learning functionality, AI analysis for customization, effortless material upload, comprehensive learning techniques, positive user feedback, professional application, tailored learning experiences, and a continuous growth platform for ongoing development.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/GFuEe6WTOok\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Develop study guides, assessments, flashcards, and summaries.</li><li>Improve the educational experience of pupils.</li><li>Expertise enhancement for professionals in any field.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://monic-ai-new.bullet.site/#:~:text=genuinely%20more%20engaged.-,Pricing,-Get%20started%20now\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://beta.monic.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/getmonicai\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/getmonicai\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/getmonicai\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/digital-axon-366208.appspot.com/o/sites%2FMslsRjyPdRutniBjZ9sc%2Flogo%2Fmonic-original.a05c3c3e22b9792a6068%20%281%29%20%282%29%20%281%29.webp?alt=media&token=0c26e739-3ec8-4a0d-9d4c-8540b8449a41\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 241,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.628Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.931Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Questgen\",\n      \"slug\": \"Questgen\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool is designed to generate a diverse array of assessments, including true/'false questions, multiple-choice questions, and higher-order questions based on Bloom&#39;s taxonomy.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Customizable Worksheets:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Users can modify and refine the generated worksheets to suit their specific requirements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Export Options:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers export capabilities in JSON or plain text format, allowing easy integration with various platforms.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Wide User Base:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Used by educators, academic institutions, HR departments, and textbook publishers to streamline assessment development.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Time and Cost Efficiency:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Reduces expenses and time involved compared to manual assessment generation processes.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Research-Informed Technology:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Built upon AI research, ensuring reliability and effectiveness in assessment generation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Open-Source Access:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides access to the open-source library via GitHub, fostering collaboration and innovation in the AI community.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Which languages does Questgen currently support?<br>While English is the primary language supported by Questgen, it also exhibits satisfactory functionality in English, Spanish, French, Hindi, and others. It is advisable to attempt inputting the text in the desired language and assess whether the result is acceptable.<br>In what quantity of content may I supply Questgen's engine as input? In what quantity are queries produced?<br>Paid-tier Questgen plans permit submission of up to 25,000 words of text. The free plan imposes a word limit of 5,000.<br>What does it mean to have unlimited cycles under fair use?<br>Hourly rate limits are implemented in the Questgen application to mitigate the risk of system exploitation. When the specified limits are exceeded, a notification is presented on the user interface, instructing users to refrain from utilizing the service again for a designated duration.<br>On the backend, these limits are administered automatically, so there is no cause for concern. In order to resume using the service after encountering these rate limits, kindly observe the passage of the specified amount of time.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool facilitates the creation of various assessments, offers customization options, export capabilities, and is utilized by diverse users across different sectors, leveraging research-informed technology to enhance efficiency and reliability.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/_gxDOx33chg\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Educational Applications: Questgen is employed by educators to develop individualized assessments that optimize learning outcomes for their students.</li><li>Recruitment Procedures: Questgen is employed by HR departments to create evaluation criteria for job candidates, thereby optimizing the recruiting process.</li><li>Questgen is utilized by textbook publishing companies to generate evaluations that are in accordance with their instructional materials, thereby augmenting the worth of their products.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.questgen.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.questgen.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/questgen_ai\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/30182152/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 240,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.627Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.929Z\",\n      \"title\": \"To teach\",\n      \"slug\": \"To-teach\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Research\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool focuses on providing personalized teaching materials to instructors, catering to the unique needs and preferences of their students.</p>\\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><p><strong>Variety of Programs:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Offers both free and paid programs with options for exercises, worksheets, and lesson plans development.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li><p><strong>Personalization:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Tailors teaching materials to match the specific needs and preferences of students, enhancing the learning experience.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li><p><strong>Human-Centered Approach:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Utilizes a human-centered approach, augmenting the instructional capabilities of educators while working collaboratively with them.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"How do I develop practice exercises of superior quality?<br>The excellence is directly correlated with the subject matter description. The worksheets currently offer a subject area that is most effective. Obtaining the intended outcome is oriented toward the structure of the deposited examples.<br>In what manner can the workbooks' quality be guaranteed?<br>Significant time and effort have been devoted to the creation and development of the current worksheets so that quality can be assured. The artificial intelligence employed for this purpose undergoes further training using the generated content. The AI gains knowledge and develops itself in this manner.Can I use it to conduct offline instruction?<br>Analog print versions of every worksheet from To Teach\\\" may also be utilized within the classroom setting. To print the worksheet\",\n      \"pricing\": \"paid\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool offers personalized teaching materials for instructors, including various programs with exercises and lesson plans, while adopting a human-centered approach to enhance the teaching process.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Tailored Lesson Plans: Applies expertise in developing individualized lesson plans that cater to the specific requirements of each student.</li><li>Personalized Exercises for Learners: Produces exercises that are individualized to suit the needs and preferences of every student.</li><li>Enhanced Teaching with AI Support: By integrating AI support, human teaching abilities are augmented, thereby increasing teaching effectiveness.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.to-teach.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/to_teach.ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://www.to-teach.ai/build/_assets/logo-Z2HDV5LC.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 239,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.626Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.928Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Storybooks\",\n      \"slug\": \"Storybooks\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Stories\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool focuses on personalized story creation, aiming to enhance literacy, creativity, and social-emotional intelligence by allowing users to easily generate personalized stories.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Personalization Options:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Customization of narratives with familiar faces, characters, and names for a unique and personalized storytelling experience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Multilingual Support:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Generation of narratives in various languages, promoting linguistic inclusivity and enabling children worldwide to access stories in their native language.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool facilitates personalized story creation, offering customization options for narratives and multilingual support to cater to diverse audiences and enhance literacy and creativity.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Education Enhancement: Facilitates language acquisition by means of interactive and individualized narratives customized to suit specific tastes.</li><li>Enhancement of Reading Comprehension: Presents readers with thought-provoking narratives that are designed to improve their critical reading abilities and comprehension.</li><li>Inspiration and Amusement: Fosters imagination and amusement by providing a platform for the creation of visually captivating and one-of-a-kind narratives.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.storybooks.app/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/storybooks_app\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/storybooksapp\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/storybooks_app\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://storage.googleapis.com/storybooks-assets/logo6.webp\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 238,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.624Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.927Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Editgpt\",\n      \"slug\": \"Editgpt\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Business\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool addresses a wide array of written materials, offering guidelines on grammar and style to enhance clarity and coherence, while adhering to established style guides such as APA.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Guidelines on Grammar and Style:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides assistance in improving the clarity and coherence of various written materials like essays, theses, resumes, cover letters, and business proposals.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Compliance with Style Guides:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Adheres to recognized style guides such as APA, ensuring conformity with established standards.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Compatibility and Accessibility:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Operates seamlessly through web browsers and as browser extensions for Chrome and Firefox, ensuring consistent usability across different platforms and devices.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Consistent Feature Updates:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Regularly receives updates with enhancements and new features, demonstrating a commitment to improving user experience and tool functionality.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Feedback Mechanism:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a feedback mechanism for users to provide suggestions and feedback, fostering active user involvement and continual application enhancement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"What is the distinction between Proofread\\\" and \\\"Proofread with flow and clarity enhancement\\\"?<br>ChatGPT produces text in response to the user-supplied prompt. By substituting various keywords into the prompt\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool caters to a variety of written materials, offering grammar and style guidelines, complying with style guides like APA, accessible across multiple platforms, and consistently updated with user-driven enhancements.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Enhance the coherence and efficacy of scholarly essays and theses.</li><li>Improve resumes and cover letters in order to present a more compelling case to prospective employers.</li><li>Utilize Polish business reports and proposals to establish credibility and professionalism.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://editgpt.app/#pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://editgpt.app/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://instagram.com/editgpt\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61553431048251\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/editgpt\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://editgpt.app/_next/image?url=%2Fhome.png&w=48&q=75\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 237,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.623Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.925Z\",\n      \"title\": \"GPTZero\",\n      \"slug\": \"GPTZero\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Teachers\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>GPTZero is an AI detection application tailored for educators and users seeking to identify texts generated by artificial intelligence, offering features to detect and assess AI-generated content.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Plagiarism Score:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides a comprehensive score indicating the amount of AI-generated content in a document for easy assessment.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Sentence Identification:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Identifies and highlights individual sentences generated by AI within the text to aid detection.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Batch Uploads:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Supports multiple file uploads, enabling efficient evaluation of extensive documents or entire classwork.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>API Integration:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Seamlessly integrates with organizational systems through configurable endpoints, enhancing workflow integration.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Do you retain the data returned by API calls?<br>No. Documents transmitted through API calls are not stored or collected by our system. We aimed to exercise extreme caution when it came to storing data from organizations that utilized our API.<br>Nevertheless, inputs from conversations initiated through our dashboard are stored. This information is utilized by GPTZero solely in aggregate to enhance the service for our users. Please consult our privacy statement for additional information.<br>When should GPTZero be utilized?<br>Through social writing platforms, disinformation, education, certification, employment and recruitment, and more, the use of AI-generated text has proliferated, as observed by our users. GPTZero was developed as a tool to demonstrate the potential application of AI in text composition. Our primary emphasis is the categorization of AI usage in prose.<br><br>The overarching goal of our classifier is to identify circumstances that merit a dialogue, such as between educators and students, in order to encourage additional investigation and raise consciousness regarding the potential hazards associated with the use of AI in written composition.Does GPTZero detect ChatGPT outputs exclusively?<br>GPTZero exhibits consistent functionality with a wide variety of AI language models, encompassing ChatGPT, GPT-4, GPT-3, GPT-2, LLaMA, and AI services that are built upon these models, among others.\",\n      \"pricing\": \"Paid\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"GPTZero is an AI detection tool designed for educators and users to identify AI-generated texts, featuring a plagiarism score, sentence identification, support for batch uploads, and seamless API integration for enhanced usability.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>GPTZero is applicable in a variety of educational environments:</li><li>Academics interested in identifying AI-generated material in student assignments Institutions planning to incorporate AI text detection into their operational frameworks</li><li>Academic institutions seeking to preserve their standing amidst the proliferation of AI-generated content</li><li>As evidenced by its expanding user base and collaborations with K16 Solutions and Canvas, GPTZero is a dependable and perpetually evolving instrument designed to identify AI-generated text.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://gptzero.me/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": \"https://facebook.com/gptzero\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/gptzeroai\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/gptzero/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://gptzero.me/logos/origin_logo_bw.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 236,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.621Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.924Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Quick Creator\",\n      \"slug\": \"Quick-Creator\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Writing Generators\",\n        \"SEO\",\n        \"Website Builders\",\n        \"Marketing\",\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Copywriting\",\n        \"E-Commerce\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Quick Creator is an innovative AI-powered application designed to revolutionize online content generation for businesses and professionals, with a focus on creating highly effective landing pages and blogs to boost conversions and online visibility.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>AI-Driven Content Creation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Delivers optimized blog posts and landing pages for SEO through advanced artificial intelligence algorithms.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Comprehensive SEO Tools:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a wide range of SEO tools specifically crafted to enhance both on-page and technical SEO elements, improving E-A-T scores.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Ultra-Fast Hosting Solutions:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Ensures timely content rendering with fast hosting solutions, optimizing user experience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Mobile-Responsive Design:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Guarantees mobile optimization for every landing page, catering to the majority of website visitors using mobile devices.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Enhanced Content Production Efficiency:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Drastically reduces time required for content creation and SEO optimization.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Superior Content Quality:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>AI algorithms generate content that outperforms competitors in search engine rankings while maintaining engagement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates content creation, making it accessible to users with varying technical proficiency levels.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Cost-Effectiveness:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enhances content production without the need for additional personnel, offering an economically viable solution for businesses.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Early Adoption Learning Curve:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Novice users may require time to fully grasp the functionalities and features of Quick Creator.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Restricted Free Trial:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>The three-day free trial period may be insufficient for users to explore all features comprehensively.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Quick Creator is an AI-powered application offering a comprehensive suite of tools for efficient content creation and SEO optimization, catering to businesses and professionals seeking to enhance their online presence and conversions. With advanced features and user-friendly interface, it optimizes content production while addressing some early adoption challenges and trial limitations.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/3Xol91bSojE\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Quick Creator caters to a wide array of clients, spanning multiple industries and ranging from solitary professionals to sizable groups:</li><li>Digital marketing agencies employ the tool to generate content that amplifies the online visibility of their clients.</li><li>Quick Creator is utilized by e-commerce companies to design landing pages that effectively convert site visitors into paying consumers.</li><li>Content creators can effectively utilize an AI-powered blog constructor to consistently produce high-quality blog content.</li><li>SEO specialists employ SEO tools to enhance their methodologies and elevate the positions of their projects in search engine results pages.</li><li>Outspoken Applications: Quick Creator is integrated into the curricula of educational institutions to impart knowledge on digital marketing and SEO to students. Additionally, it is utilized by nonprofit organizations to construct persuasive narratives and encourage action on their websites.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://quickcreator.io/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://quickcreator.io/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quick-creator/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"data:image/webp;base64,\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 235,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.617Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:09:27.174Z\",\n      \"title\": \"JustLearn\",\n      \"slug\": \"JustLearn\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Fun\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>JustLearn.com is an online platform connecting language learners with native speakers and top-tier language instructors worldwide. It accelerates language learning through its marketplace and enables users to create personalized three-dimensional digital personas for various purposes like gaming and virtual interactions.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Connection Facilitation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Introduces students to native speakers and language tutors for enhanced learning.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Global Language Instructors:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides access to language instructors from around the world, ensuring diverse teaching styles and expertise.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Accelerated Learning Marketplace:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a marketplace specifically designed to expedite language learning for students.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Personalized 3D Avatars:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enables users to create and customize three-dimensional digital characters for gaming, virtual teachings, and other applications.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"JustLearn.com connects language learners with native speakers and instructors globally, facilitating accelerated language learning through its marketplace, while also allowing users to create personalized 3D avatars for various purposes.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Employ case studies</li><li>Students of languages are matched with tutors.</li><li>Improving the quality of 3D avatars used in virtual discussions and teachings.</li><li>Avatar usage for language practice and gaming.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://justlearn.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://assets-global.website-files.com/65e724856c9bb00e12e26d0a/65f328cc7dff8080b4383428_justlearn-logo-full-green.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 234,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.606Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.921Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Education CoPilot\",\n      \"slug\": \"Education-CoPilot\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Prompts\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>AI Lesson Planner is an educational application tailored to streamline the process of lesson plan preparation, offering a variety of templates and resources to enhance academic efficiency and improve student learning experiences.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Assortment of Templates and Resources:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Generates templates for lesson plans, prompts, educational materials, student reports, and project outlines, providing comprehensive support for educators.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Time-Saving Aids:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers over ten time-saving aids beyond classroom activities, enabling teachers to efficiently manage their instructional materials and administrative tasks.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Multilingual Assistance:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Accommodates users by providing content in both English and Spanish, catering to a diverse audience and promoting inclusivity.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Focus on Academic Efficiency:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Aims to deliver structured, high-quality lesson plans and resources, allowing educators to save time and effort in lesson preparation while prioritizing academic effectiveness.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Enhanced Pupil Learning Experiences:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Emphasizes the enhancement of pupil learning experiences through well-designed lesson plans and educational resources, fostering a conducive learning environment.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"AI Lesson Planner is an educational tool designed to streamline lesson plan preparation, offering a range of templates and resources to support educators in creating structured and high-quality lesson plans. With multilingual assistance and a focus on academic efficiency, it aims to improve pupil learning experiences while conserving time and effort for teachers.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Efficient Lesson Planning: Promotes streamlined lesson planning processes, thereby conserving educators' valuable time.</li><li>Structured Lesson Plans and Resources: Offers an assortment of resources and structured lesson plans to support teaching objectives.</li><li>Enhanced Student Learning Outcomes: Facilitates the improvement of student learning outcomes through the provision of effective instructional strategies and resources to educators.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://educationcopilot.com/pricing/\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://educationcopilot.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://educationcopilot.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Blue-Modern-Vezzra-Modern-Technology-Logo-1.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 233,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.603Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.920Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Charley\",\n      \"slug\": \"Charley\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The Essay Generation tool is designed to create captivating essays with a maximum word count of 15,000 words, providing users with topic suggestions and illustrative essays to inspire creativity.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Essay Generation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Generates intriguing essays with a maximum word count of 15,000 words, catering to various writing needs.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Topic Examples and Suggestions:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers topic recommendations and illustrative essays to stimulate creativity and assist users in selecting engaging subjects.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Adaptable Functionality:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Modifies output to align with desired grade levels and writing styles, ensuring suitability for diverse audiences.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Text Editor and Customization:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Integrates a text editor for additional refinement and customization, allowing users to adjust essay type, tone, and word count according to their preferences.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"How is Charley operational?<br>Charley is the market's most sophisticated penmanship system. Our proprietary AI (artificial intelligence) generates content of the utmost quality by combining GPT-3 with custom data.<br>Does Charley compose an essay from the ground up?<br>Charley will, in fact, compose your essay from beginning. Your content remains your own, and you retain the ability to modify anything Charley has written. By eliminating tedious and repetitious tasks, Charley enables you to concentrate more on the creative aspects of content creation. It remains your duty to verify and ascertain the veracity of all facts and statements produced by Charley AI.Is Charley free of plagiarism?<br>Charley make every effort to ensure that her written content is free from any instances of plagiarism. However, occasionally there may be sentences that are also available online; to verify this, you can utilize Charley in conjunction with a plagiarism detector.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The Essay Generation tool empowers users to create captivating essays with customizable features, including topic suggestions, adaptable functionality for different grade levels and writing styles, and a built-in text editor for further refinement, catering to various writing needs and preferences.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Academic Essays: Optimal for generating scholarly essays.</li><li>Blog or Website Content: Assists in the development of blog or website content.</li><li>Contributes effectively to the composition of articles and reports.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://charley.ai/#pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://charley.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://charley.ai/logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 232,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.599Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.918Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Eduwriter AI\",\n      \"slug\": \"Eduwriter-AI\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Writing\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The On-Demand Unique Essay Generation tool provides original essay compositions for students, offering support for academic assignments across various subjects.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Artificial Intelligence Technology:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes AI technology to analyze text from different sources and user inputs, ensuring original and high-quality content.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Subject Flexibility:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Allows users to choose any subject matter for essay composition, facilitating the process of essay writing.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Academic Support:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Assists in the development of college essays and academic assignments, promoting the creation of unique content.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Simple Usage Procedure:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Requires users to enter the topic, complete a &quot;Recaptcha&quot; verification, and click the &quot;write&quot; icon for essay generation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Customization Options:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enables users to modify the generated content to ensure originality and meet specific requirements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Diverse Essay Forms:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Capable of composing various essay forms, including argumentative, expository, and narrative compositions.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Tailored Essay Creation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides a user-friendly interface and a wealth of resources to accommodate diverse essay writing needs.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The On-Demand Unique Essay Generation tool employs AI technology to deliver original and high-quality essay compositions, offering flexibility in subject choice, academic support, and customization options to meet students' diverse writing requirements.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Implementations: generating original essays for academic tasks.</li><li>Producing intellectually sound content for scholarly articles.</li><li>Creatively producing content for websites and blogs.</li><li>The simplification of the essay writing procedure.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://eduwriter.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://eduwriter.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/eduwriter_ai\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61551477587326\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/eduwriter_ai\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eduwriter/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://eduwriter.ai/templates/images/menu_logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 231,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.596Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.917Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Quizbot\",\n      \"slug\": \"Quizbot\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Quizbot is an AI application designed to generate superior-quality English test questions using Bloom&#39;s taxonomy, offering various question formats and customization options.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Question Generation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes Bloom&#39;s taxonomy to generate high-quality English test questions.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Multiple Question Formats:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides templates for open-ended, multiple-choice, true-'false, fill-in-the-blank, and short-answer inquiries.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Content Input:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Allows users to upload text, links, and videos to generate questions.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Customization Options:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enables modification of the tool to match the user&#39;s personal writing style.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Does Quizly.ai support users?<br>The intuitive user interface renders Quizly.ai simple to operate. A minimalist design guarantees that users are able to efficiently grasp and employ the functionalities of the platform.<br>Exploring areas and locating features is simplified by the appealing, tidy, and well-structured design.<br>Is my data protected by Quizly.ai?<br>Each uploaded file is temporarily cached and subsequently utilized by our AI model to generate inquiries.<br>Following the creation of your queries, the cache is cleared and your document is removed. Quizly.ai places a premium on user privacy and security. Quizly implemented stringent security measures in order to safeguard user information and provide a secure user experience.Every interaction between a user and the Quizly.ai platform is encrypted using industry-standard protocols. During exchanges, this encrypts and safeguards personal information and questionnaire responses.Which inquiries may I anticipate?<br>You are able to create multiple queries for distinct objectives using Quizly. You are able to create inquiries on a variety of topics and scales using Quizly. A comprehensive enumeration of query types is provided below:<br>1. Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs) consist of a stem or issue statement that is succeeded by a set of multiple-choice options. On the examination, the student is required to select the correct response. MCQs furnish an avenue to assess factual knowledge, comprehension, and practical skills.<br>2. True/'false Questions: Examinees are required to determine whether given statements are true or 'false.<br>3. Complete the Blanks: An expression or statement is devoid of words. Examinees are required to provide valid responses.<br>4. Matching Exercises: Compile sets of two similar objects. In order to test, it is necessary to link corresponding elements from each set.<br>5. Short Answer Questions: Responses should be succinct, devoid of any explanations or alternatives.<br>6. Essay Questions: For essay questions, examinees may elaborate on their thoughts and ideas in paragraph format.<br>7. Image-Based Questions: Students are able to provide responses to images on Quizly.<br>You are able to create these and other question varieties using Quizly. Personalize the inquiries to correspond with your requirements and inclinations. Create interactive assessments and exams with Quizly for use in education, staff development, market research, and more.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Quizbot, an AI application, employs Bloom's taxonomy to produce superior-quality English test questions, offering multiple question formats and customization options to match users' preferences and writing styles.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Online Courses: Enables the development of exams for online courses, thereby supporting the evaluation and reinforcement of knowledge.</li><li>Student Practice Tests: Facilitates the expeditious creation of preparatory exams for learners, thereby encouraging efficient study and readiness.</li><li>The evaluation of employee knowledge in training programs assists organizations in determining levels of performance and comprehension.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://quizly.ai/#pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://quizly.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/quizly/\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=10009158329680\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/Quizly\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://quizly.ai/upload/images/logo/rofR--quizlyai-logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 230,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.591Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.912Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Curipod\",\n      \"slug\": \"Curipod\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Teaching\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Curipod is an educator-specific tool designed to facilitate discussions and seamlessly record student voices, provided at no cost.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Flexible Functionality:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers various functionalities including word clouds, questionnaires, open-ended inquiries, drawings, and Q&amp;A sessions to foster diverse student engagement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Personalized Templates:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides customizable templates tailored to meet the unique needs of individual instructors and classroom environments.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Promoting Student Engagement:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Aims to promote lively participation among students, ensuring each student&#39;s perspective is valued and acknowledged.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Curipod is an educator-focused tool offering diverse functionalities and personalized templates to foster student engagement and facilitate discussions, enabling inclusive and dynamic learning environments.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Promoting Classroom Dialogues: Fosters animated classroom dialogues through the implementation of activities like polls, open-ended inquiries, and question-and-answer sessions, thereby increasing student involvement.</li><li>Evaluating Student Comprehension: This feature enables instructors to monitor students' progress in learning and comprehension by employing interactive surveys and open-ended inquiries.</li><li>Facilitates collaborative learning experiences through the use of word clouds and question-and-answer sessions, encouraging students to share and expand upon one another's ideas and perspectives.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://curipod.com/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://curipod.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/curipod\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/curipodofficial\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/curipod/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 229,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.588Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.911Z\",\n      \"title\": \"explainpaper\",\n      \"slug\": \"explainpaper\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Explainpaper is an online platform utilizing AI and machine learning to deliver comprehensible summaries and explanations of scholarly papers, aiding users in understanding complex academic material.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>AI and Machine Learning Integration:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes advanced AI and machine learning technologies to generate summaries and explanations of submitted papers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Enhanced Comprehension:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides concise summaries and explanations to aid users in quickly grasping complex concepts within academic papers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Streamlined Understanding:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Expedites the process of understanding intricate academic material, facilitating efficient learning and research.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Explainpaper employs AI and machine learning to provide users with comprehensible summaries and explanations of scholarly papers, aiding in the understanding of complex academic material.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>The accessibility of information is enhanced as users are able to readily locate responses to particular inquiries within a document, thereby optimizing the procedure of acquiring pertinent data.</li><li>In addition, Explainpaper provides the functionality to produce succinct summaries that are appropriate for research objectives, aiding scholars in the efficient synthesis of extensive quantities of information.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.explainpaper.com/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.explainpaper.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/explain_paper\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 228,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.584Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.909Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Coursemind\",\n      \"slug\": \"Coursemind\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Teachers\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool is designed to streamline online school and organizational administration through the integration of AI technology, ensuring a seamless educational experience.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Comprehensive Course Development:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enables easy creation of detailed courses with comprehensive instructions and various content creation tools.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Interactive Learning Experience:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Supports the development of interactive and engaging courses to enhance student engagement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Marketing Toolkit:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides a suite of marketing tools including landing page generators and email automation systems.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Efficient Promotion and Revenue Generation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates effective course promotion and revenue generation through streamlined administration.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool simplifies online school and organizational administration, offering features for course development, interactive learning experiences, marketing support, and efficient promotion, ensuring a seamless educational journey.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Manage online institutions or organizations with efficiency.</li><li>Develop interactive and captivating courses.</li><li>To generate income, promote courses and educational materials.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://coursemind.io/intro#pricings\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://coursemind.io/intro?lang=en\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100091342179499\",\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@coursemindai\",\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://storage.googleapis.com/protonx-cdn/CourseMind-black.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 227,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.581Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.908Z\",\n      \"title\": \"OpenDream\",\n      \"slug\": \"OpenDream\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Art Generation\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool offers a range of models tailored to specific artistic preferences and needs, enabling users to efficiently create or modify images with endless possibilities.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Model Variety:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Four unique models cater to different artistic preferences and requirements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Endless Image Creation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Empowers users to modify existing images or generate an infinite number of original ones.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Rapid Processing Times:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes servers equipped with GPUs for lightning-fast processing, accelerating outcomes.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Online Accessibility:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Eliminates the need for physical device transport, providing convenient access from anywhere.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Streamlined Operation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a seamless and interruption-free operating system for enhanced user experience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Suitable for All Skill Levels:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Appropriate for students and professional artists alike, accommodating diverse levels of graphic design experience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Restricted Version:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides a free version with specific limitations.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Subscription Benefits:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Subscribers gain access to additional functionalities and capabilities beyond the free version.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Is subscription transferability possible to another user or account?<br>No, subscriptions cannot be transferred to alternative users or accounts. Every purchased subscription is associated with a particular user or account, and it is not possible to transfer it to another person or account. In order to utilize the functionalities of OpenDream, an additional user would be required to procure a subscription.<br>Is it possible to suspend or halt my subscription temporarily?<br>Yes, it is possible to suspend or halt your OpenDream subscription temporarily. This enables you to discontinue the service without incurring any charges during that time. For guidance on precisely how to suspend your subscription, it is advisable to consult the official documentation provided by OpenDream or reach out to their customer support department.What occurs if my subscription is canceled?<br>Upon terminating your subscription, you will retain the entitlement to utilize all the credits that were previously subscribed to. Once the credits from your paid plan have been depleted, your account will be retroactively downgraded to the free plan.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool encompasses four unique models tailored to specific artistic preferences, enabling users to create or modify images efficiently. It offers rapid processing, online accessibility, and is suitable for users of all skill levels, with both free and subscription-based versions available.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Original Art Creation: Provides a platform for artistic expression by facilitating the creation of original artwork.</li><li>Image Modification: Facilitates the modification of pre-existing images, thereby augmenting users' ingenuity and adaptability.</li><li>Professional graphic design projects can benefit from this product, as it effectively fulfills the requirements of a wide range of creative endeavors.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://opendream.ai/plans\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://opendream.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://opendream.ai/assets/img/logo.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"art_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 226,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.577Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.907Z\",\n      \"title\": \"ResearchRabbit\",\n      \"slug\": \"ResearchRabbit\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The comprehensive set of instruments is tailored to meet the needs of researchers, facilitating exploration, visualization, and extraction of insights from scholarly articles.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Investigate Pertinent Research Papers:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides resources for efficiently locating relevant research papers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Effectively Visualize Research Data:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates the visualization of research data to aid researchers in their analysis.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Collaboration and Commenting:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enables researchers to collaborate and offer feedback on research papers, fostering collaboration within the research community.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": \"free\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Tailored to researchers' requirements, this tool set assists in exploring, visualizing, and extracting insights from scholarly articles, offering features for investigating research papers, visualizing data, and facilitating collaboration among researchers.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Facilitates the identification of pertinent research papers within the field of study for researchers.</li><li>Facilitates the visualization of intricate research data in order to enhance comprehension.</li><li>Facilitates Collaboration on Research Papers: Offers a platform for researchers to collaborate and provide feedback on research papers, thereby encouraging collaboration among them.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.researchrabbit.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"http://twitter.com/RsrchRabbit\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5dee82c56fcd7b0290640db5/2d9c67bf-a7e9-4810-8948-45ce24546798/logo.png?format=1500w\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 225,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.574Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.905Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Writefull\",\n      \"slug\": \"Writefull\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Paraphraser\",\n        \"Research\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p><strong>Tool Summary:</strong></p> \\n<p>Writefull is an AI-driven academic writing tool designed to assist scholars and students in their scholarly writing tasks, offering a range of features to enhance language usage and content creation.</p> \\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Language Feedback:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides feedback on language usage to enhance writing quality.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Paraphrasing and Rewording:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers capabilities for text paraphrasing and rewording to improve clarity and originality.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Abstract and Title Generation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates the generation of abstracts and titles for academic papers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Academizer Function:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Includes an academizer function specifically tailored for academic writing support.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Enhanced Writing Elements:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides various elements to assist in constructing language and sentences for improved writing.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Accessibility and Compatibility:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Desktop Download:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a desktop download option for convenient access to the application.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Integration with Word and Overleaf:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Fully compatible with popular writing platforms like Word and Overleaf for seamless revision and publication.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Privacy and Protection:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Rapid and Secure Revision:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides a rapid and secure text revision method for user convenience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Complete Encryption:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Ensures complete data encryption to safeguard user privacy.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Absence of Text Storage:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Does not store user text to maintain data security and confidentiality.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Summary:</strong> \\nWritefull, an AI-powered academic writing tool, offers language feedback, paraphrasing, abstract generation, and other features to assist scholars and students in writing scholarly content, ensuring accessibility, compatibility, and privacy protection.</p> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"How do I acquire Writefull Premium for the entire organization?<br>Institutions can obtain licenses and complimentary trials from us. If your institution acquires a license, Writefull Premium becomes complimentary for you. Request that a member of your staff, including a supervisor, librarian, or IT contact, complete this trial request form to initiate the process. Additionally, you may connect us with the staff member directly.<br>What distinguishes Writefull from all other language tools?<br>Writefull was created by a group of AI and linguistics Ph.D. candidates. Its language feedback is tailored to research writing and is more exhaustive and precise than that of competing tools. Writefull provides a range of writing aids in addition to language feedback. These aids consist of an automated paraphraser, abstract generator, title generator, academizer, language search database containing academic texts, and sentence palette containing example sentences. Read on for additional distinctions between Writefull and Grammarly.Is Writefull compatible with every academic field?<br>Writefull is compatible with the arts, humanities, sciences, technology, engineering, medicine, and sciences, as well as the social sciences and humanities. Because Writefull's language models are trained on millions of published journal articles spanning all scientific disciplines, this is the case.\",\n      \"pricing\": \"Paid\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Writefull, an AI-powered academic writing tool, offers language feedback, paraphrasing, abstract generation, and other features to assist scholars and students in writing scholarly content, ensuring accessibility, compatibility, and privacy protection.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Enhance Coherence and Clarity in Academic Writing: Writeful can be utilized to enhance and revise academic writing by increasing coherence and clarity.</li><li>Produce Abstracts and Titles: For scholarly articles, employ Writeful to generate succinct abstracts and engaging titles.</li><li>Utilize Writeful's paraphrasing and rewording features to guarantee the integrity of your work and prevent instances of plagiarism.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.writefull.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/writefull_ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"http://twitter.com/Writefullapp\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/writefull/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://www.writefull.com/writefull-logo.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 224,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.568Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.904Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Yoodli\",\n      \"slug\": \"Yoodli\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Coaching\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Yoodli is an AI-powered tool designed to provide personalized feedback to users on their public speaking skills, offering detailed analysis and guidance to improve performance in various contexts.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Personalized Feedback:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides customized feedback tailored to each user&#39;s public speaking abilities.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Speech Analysis:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a detailed analysis of speech patterns and delivery, including grammar evaluation and um count.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Performance Measurement:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes data to help users gauge their speaking speed, naturalness, and overall progress over time.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Applicability:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Suitable for a variety of scenarios, including professional interviews, investor presentations, and casual conversations.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Coaching and Support:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers individualized coaching and expert-crafted support to enhance impromptu speaking skills.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Can I utilize Yodi for routine phone calls?<br>Yes. Yoodli is compatible with all video conferencing platforms, including Webex, Zoom, Google Hangouts, and Microsoft Teams. Yoodli is available in both private and team scenarios.<br><br>Coaches and teams are encouraged to use Team mode, in which Yoodli participates in the call as a member and provides analytics for each speaker.<br>During private mode, Yoodli exclusively records the user, eliminating the need to disclose the use of an AI speech coach (other participants are not recorded by Yoodli).<br>I have a profession as a communication consultant. How do I operate Yoodi?<br>Thousands of communication coaches (including speech coaches, SLPs, media trainers, and interview instructors) are our clients. Consider Yoodli to be the medical report if you were the physician. We handle tedious duties (such as generating transcripts, monitoring client progress, and counting filler words) so that you can concentrate on the intricacies of coaching. Yoodli facilitates time savings, client acquisition, and improved coaching outcomes.<br>After registering for Yoodli, ensure that the I'm a coach\\\" response option is selected in the induction survey.How protected are my files?<br>Your speeches are your property. They are accessible only to you and cannot be shared with another user. We never disclose or sell your information with third parties. Your information is stored on Google's secure servers\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Yoodli delivers personalized feedback on public speaking skills, featuring speech analysis, performance measurement, and coaching support, making it applicable for various contexts such as interviews, presentations, and casual conversations.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/BErcHaCt5rA\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Enhancement of Job Interview Skills Yoodli has the capability to aid users in the improvement of their job interview skills.</li><li>Enhanced Investor proposal Delivery: Assists users in refining their investor proposal delivery, thereby ensuring its efficacy.</li><li>Enhanced Proficiency in Routine Conversations: Assists individuals in improving their aptitude for routine conversations, thereby cultivating superior communication.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://app.yoodli.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://app.yoodli.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/yoodli\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/yoodli/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 223,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.566Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.902Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Scisummary\",\n      \"slug\": \"Scisummary\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>SciSummary is an AI-driven application designed to generate concise summaries of scholarly articles and research papers, catering to students, scientists, and science enthusiasts seeking to stay updated on the latest research developments.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>GPT-3 Technology:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes GPT-3 technology to produce succinct and accurate summaries.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Accessibility:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>The public beta version is available free of charge, ensuring accessibility for all users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Supports article submissions via email, URLs, or PDF attachments for user convenience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Efficient Delivery:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Delivers summaries directly to the user&#39;s inbox within minutes, enhancing information assimilation efficiency.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Contact Options:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Users can reach out for support or inquiries via email or phone.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": \"paid\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"SciSummari employs AI technology to generate concise summaries of scholarly articles and research papers, offering a user-friendly interface and efficient delivery of summaries to users' inboxes, with free accessibility and multiple contact options available for support.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Implementations: Rapidly condense scientific articles for researchers who are limited in time.</li><li>Provide science devotees with succinct summaries.</li><li>Provide support to learners in comprehending intricate research papers.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://scisummary.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://scisummary.com/img/logo.webp\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 222,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.564Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:05:28.707Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Gliglish\",\n      \"slug\": \"Gliglish\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\",\n        \"Language learning\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Gliglish is a language learning platform that offers complimentary listening and speaking practice sessions without requiring registration. Users can access language practice anytime, anywhere, focusing on pronunciation improvement through natural voice learning.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Active Listening and Speaking:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides practice sessions for listening and speaking without registration.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Fluency Enhancement:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Allows language practice at any time and location for improved fluency.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Pronunciation Placement:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Emphasizes enhancing pronunciation through natural voice learning.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Speech Enhancement Suggestions:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides suggestions for improving speech and adjusting speech pace.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Multilingual Support:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Supports various languages including English (US, UK, Australia), French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, and Russian.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Continuous Language Support Augmentation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Constantly adds language support to meet user needs.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Confidence Building:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Assists users in developing confidence in verbal exchanges for professional interviews or social engagements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Upgrade Options:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Users can upgrade to Gliglish Plus for extended practice sessions and priority access to new features.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Gliglish is a language learning platform offering complimentary listening and speaking practice sessions, emphasizing pronunciation improvement and providing multilingual support, with upgrade options available for extended practice sessions.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Employ Gliglish Use Cases to effectively hone your listening and speaking abilities.</li><li>Develop your conviction when speaking multiple languages.</li><li>Prepare in foreign languages for social interactions and job interviews.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://gliglish.com/#pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://gliglish.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://gliglish.com/static/img/logo-white-500.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 221,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.563Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.900Z\",\n      \"title\": \"The-Good-AI\",\n      \"slug\": \"The-Good-AI\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The essay generation tool utilizes AI technology to produce precisely structured essays with customization options, unique titles, and advanced outline functions, ensuring superior quality articles.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Rapid Essay Generation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Produces essays quickly with precise structure and error-free content.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Customization Options:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Allows users to customize topics, essay formats, and word counts according to their preferences.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>AI-Powered Content Editing:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enables users to edit and contribute content using AI-powered auto-complete capabilities.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Unique Essay Titles:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Generates distinctive essay titles to enhance originality and creativity.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Superior Quality Articles:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes a neural network AI model to retrieve millions of high-quality articles.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Advanced Essay Outlines:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides advanced essay outline functions to improve coherence and organization.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The essay generation tool employs AI technology to swiftly produce structured essays, offering customization options, unique titles, and advanced outline functions for superior quality articles.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Rapid Generation of Essays for Students: Offers an expeditious resolution for pupils requiring efficient essay composition.</li><li>Providing businesses with the means to generate content for a multitude of objectives while guaranteeing its quality and pertinence.</li><li>Academic Research Paper Writing: Provides support to scholars in the composition of precise and accurate research papers.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.the-good-ai.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 220,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.561Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.898Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Connected Papers\",\n      \"slug\": \"Connected-Papers\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The Research and Knowledge-Sharing Platform serves as an internet-based repository, facilitating access to recent research and scholarly articles for scientists, researchers, and students.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Distinctive Visual Instrument:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Aids in the identification and examination of pertinent papers through a unique visual tool.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Access to Recent Research:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers access to the most recent research and insights in various subjects.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Organized Repository:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides scholarly articles and research papers organized into collections based on keywords and subject matters.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The Research and Knowledge-Sharing Platform is an internet-based repository that aids scientists, researchers, and students in accessing recent research and scholarly articles, offering a unique visual instrument for paper identification and organization by subject matter.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>The literature review aids in the identification of pertinent scholarly articles that can be utilized to conduct the review.</li><li>Investigating Emerging Trends and Developments: Enables users to investigate new research within particular fields, thereby facilitating the identification of such developments.</li><li>Maintaining Current: Provides users with the ability to access the most recent scholarly materials, guaranteeing they are well-informed regarding developments and discoveries in their specific disciplines.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.connectedpapers.com/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.connectedpapers.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/ConnectedPapers\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 219,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.559Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.897Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Consensus\",\n      \"slug\": \"Consensus\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI-powered search engine facilitates evidence-based research across a wide range of subjects, including poverty reduction and COVID-19 vaccinations, by providing immediate access to critical findings extracted from scientific publications.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Extensive Range of Subjects:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enables users to locate peer-reviewed studies and scientific research on various topics.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Key Finding Extraction:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides immediate access to critical findings extracted from scientific publications.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Immediate Analysis:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers immediate analysis of extracted data for enhanced insights.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Ad-Free Search Results:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Ensures ad-free search results, focusing exclusively on scientific research.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Universal Access to Expert Knowledge:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Promotes democratization by ensuring universal access to expert knowledge.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI-powered search engine offers evidence-based research across diverse subjects, providing immediate access to critical findings, ad-free search results, and promoting democratization through universal access to expert knowledge.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Use Cases: Locate scientific studies pertaining to COVID-19 vaccines.</li><li>Investigate peer-reviewed research on the reduction of destitution.</li><li>Key findings extracted from scientific papers.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://consensus.app/pricing?synthesize=on\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://consensus.app/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/consensusnlp/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/ConsensusNLP\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/consensus-nlp/\",\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@consensus_nlp\",\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://consensus.app/home/wp-content/themes/confluance/images/redesign/home/logo-full.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 218,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.558Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.896Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Jenni AI\",\n      \"slug\": \"Jenni-AI\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Writing\",\n        \"Essay\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool implements artificial intelligence to streamline content production, offering diverse support for idea generation, thought organization, and topic investigation, alongside essay writing assistance and grammar correction.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Diverse Support:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates idea generation, thought organization, and topic investigation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Essay Writing Assistance:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Provides an integrated essay writing generator and assistant for improved essay quality and productivity.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Grammar and Punctuation Corrections:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Enhances overall accuracy by rectifying errors in grammar and punctuation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Optimizing Sentence Structure and Flow:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers recommendations to enhance sentence structure and flow for smoother reading.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Is Jenni a user of GPT-4?<br>We do utilize the most recent AI models. Certain product characteristics leverage the capabilities of GPT-4.<br>Jenni, is she multilingual?<br>Yes, you can create text in the language of your choosing and transition between languages using our translate function.<br>Is Jenni a plagiarist?<br>Jenni endeavors to produce 100 percent original, non-plagiarized content. Nonetheless, Jenni may occasionally compose sentences that are also available online.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool employs artificial intelligence to streamline content production, offering support for idea generation, essay writing assistance, grammar correction, and sentence structure optimization.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Efficient Content Generation: Facilitates rapid content production for a multitude of objectives.</li><li>Essay Writing Assistance: Provides aid in the composition of superior-quality essays within a reduced time period.</li><li>Grammar and Spelling Correction: Offers support in the identification and rectification of errors related to spelling and grammar.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://jenni.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://jenni.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 217,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.556Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.894Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Semanticscholar\",\n      \"slug\": \"Semanticscholar\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"Research\",\n        \"Education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The Semant Reader is a scientific literature search tool with access to over 211 million papers, designed to enhance scientific reading experiences while prioritizing efficiency, inclusivity, and environmental sustainability.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Extensive Scientific Literature Access:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Grants access to over 211 million papers in the field of science.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Developer-Friendly API:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Designed to empower developers in constructing Scholar applications for optimized usability and personalization.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Beta Version Availability:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Offers a beta version aimed at enhancing scientific reading experiences.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Utilization of AI Technology:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Employs technology developed by the Allen Institute for Artificial Intelligence.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Objectives for Efficiency and Inclusivity:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Aims to improve the efficiency and inclusiveness of AI research procedures.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Environmental Sustainability Focus:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Strives to minimize the environmental impact associated with artificial intelligence research endeavors.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"From where does Semantic Scholar obtain its papers?<br>The content of Semantic Scholar is obtained through web indexing as well as collaborative partnerships with content providers, scientific journals, and indexes. A list of our sources is available on the page dedicated to our publisher partners.<br>What varieties of content are incorporated into Semantic Scholar?<br>The present corpus comprises scholarly articles spanning across all disciplines of science. We index content from PubMed, arXiv, Springer Nature, and other prominent scientific publishers and indexes.<br>The emphasis of coverage is on scholarly articles. If you are interested in viewing additional forms of content, including patents, books, or datasets, please get in touch with us.How do I obtain complete access to a paper's text?<br>Access options for papers of interest can be found beneath the abstract of the paper, which is situated on the paper detail page.<br>You will be presented with the following options beneath the abstract: View PDF, View Paper, or View via Publisher, should we have a link to a paper or PDF available. By selecting the 'View' option, you will be redirected to either a full-text PDF or the publisher's website, which may provide the most optimal access methods for the paper. If the paper is not available for free, you might be redirected to the website of the publisher, where you can make a purchase of the paper.<br>In the event that the abstract lacks a source link and the text displays No Paper Link Available\\\" alongside it\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Semant Reader is a scientific literature search tool with access to a vast repository of papers, featuring a developer-friendly API, beta version availability, utilization of AI technology, and a focus on improving efficiency, inclusivity, and environmental sustainability in AI research procedures.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Efficient Literature Review: Enables researchers and academicians to conduct comprehensive and streamlined literature reviews.</li><li>Develops Scholar applications to facilitate the creation of individualized solutions for a wide range of research requirements.</li><li>Augmented Scientific Reading: Fosters a more profound comprehension and insight by enhancing scientific reading experiences via augmented features.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.semanticscholar.org/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": 