",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.roshi.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.roshi.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/LearnWithRoshi\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://www.roshi.ai/logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 213,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.550Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.889Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Aistote\",\n      \"slug\": \"Aistote\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool offers a versatile solution for generating learning materials from various sources, ensuring usability across multiple platforms and providing personalized learning experiences through customizable quizzes and flashcards. Its intuitive interface enhances accessibility and simplicity of use for all users.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Adaptable Input Formats:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Generates learning materials from PDF, URL, or text sources for increased adaptability.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Cross-Platform Availability:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Accessible on iOS, Android, and Windows devices for usability across multiple platforms.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Customizable Quizzes and Flashcards:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates personalized learning experiences by adapting instructional materials to individual preferences.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Intuitive Interface:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Guarantees accessibility and simplicity of use through an intuitive interface for creating and interacting with educational materials.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": \"paid\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool provides learners with an engaging and efficient solution by delivering personalized, interactive study materials that enhance the efficiency and enjoyment of independent study.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Ideal for students who are looking to improve their retention by utilizing thought-provoking study materials.</li><li>Self-Learners: Appropriate for individuals who are interested in mastering new subjects at an individualized rate.</li><li>Educators: Offers supplementary materials and additional resources to aid educators in their efforts to improve student learning.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://bento.me/aistote\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/aistote_app/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 212,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.547Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.886Z\",\n      \"title\": \"TeacherMatic\",\n      \"slug\": \"TeacherMatic\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"productivity\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>TeacherMatic is an AI-driven platform designed to assist teachers in maximizing productivity by organizing their workload efficiently.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>GPT-3 Technology Integration:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Utilizes GPT-3 technology to create lesson plans, exercises, worksheets, and other educational tools.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Lesson Objectives Generation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Automatically creates learning objectives based on Bloom&#39;s taxonomy&#39;s six cognitive learning domains.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Multiple Choice Quiz Maker:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Easily creates multiple-choice questions on any subject and exports them in standard formats compatible with various Virtual Learning Environments (VLEs) and Learning Management Systems (LMSs).</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Scheme of Work Generator:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates class planning and organization by generating comprehensive job breakdowns.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Class Question Generator:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Creates relevant and engaging questions to foster student involvement and interaction.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Rubric Creation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Generates assessment grading standards to maintain consistency and fairness in assessments.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"What are the 'Generators' in TeacherMatic?<br>The TeacherMatic generators are a collection of procedures that we have created to guarantee that, when a user requests something from GPT-3 (such as a lesson plan), the output is consistently of high quality and is provided in the appropriate format.  Our generators work in the background, modifying the teacher's input query to yield the best results. We have tweaked\\\" the generators for hours in order to achieve the finest results.  Teachers can find it easy to make sure that the result from GPT-3 satisfies their expectations because many of the generators additionally provide extra modifiers (such as educational attainment level).<br>How does TeacherMatic lessen the workload for educators?<br>It takes a lot of effort to design all the tools teachers need to instruct\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"TeacherMatic, powered by GPT-3 technology, assists teachers in organizing their workload efficiently through features like automatic lesson objectives generation, multiple-choice quiz maker, scheme of work generator, class question generator, and rubric creation.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/6F-XMaLU2-U\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Trials and Comments: In the UK, more than 300 instructors and lecturers have taken an active interest in giving feedback and experimenting with TeacherMatic in the classroom.</li><li>Educational contexts: Adult education programs, teacher training programs, and colleges are just a few of the educational contexts where TeacherMatic has been effectively deployed.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://teachermatic.com/pricing/\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://teachermatic.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": \"https://facebook.com/teachermatic\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/teachermaticai\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/teachermatic/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://teachermatic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/main-colour-transparent-w-padding-1.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 211,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.545Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.884Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Trivai\",\n      \"slug\": \"Trivai\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"fun tools\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Trivai is an AI-driven trivia application designed to entertain users and challenge them with an endless array of trivia questions, offering a fun and thought-provoking way to test one&#39;s knowledge and engage with friends.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Automatic Question Generation:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Generates an infinite number of trivia questions on various topics automatically.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Random Question Selection:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Obtains questions randomly from a variety of categories to create an engaging quiz experience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": \"free\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Trivai, an AI-driven trivia application, generates endless trivia questions automatically across various topics and selects questions randomly for an engaging quiz experience.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Knowledge Assessment: Provides users with the opportunity to evaluate their aptitude by presenting trivia questions spanning multiple categories.</li><li>Friendly Competitions: This feature empowers users to compete against their peers by exchanging trivia questions generated by Trivai.</li><li>Trivai is an AI-driven trivia application that provides trivia enthusiasts with a streamlined and pleasurable experience.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://trivai.app/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 210,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.544Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.883Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Tandem GPT\",\n      \"slug\": \"Tandem-GPT\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Tandem GPT is an innovative AI language companion designed to enhance language proficiency through thought-provoking dialogues. It offers users flexibility in language acquisition, accommodating individual schedules, and providing 24/7 accessibility. Additionally, it facilitates listening and pronunciation skill development through voice messaging.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><p><strong>Flexibility in Language Acquisition:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Allows users to learn languages at their own pace and schedule.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>24/7 Accessibility:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Available around the clock to accommodate users&#39; diverse schedules.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><p><strong>Voice Messaging:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li>Facilitates listening and pronunciation skill development through voice messages.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_d