ish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 193,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.514Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.857Z\",\n      \"title\": \"ES.AI\",\n      \"slug\": \"ES.AI\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"copywriting\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"writing generators\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI-powered writing tool is designed to assist young professionals and students in creating compelling essays and narratives, enhancing application materials through advanced technology.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Ethical Support:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers affordable and high-quality writing tools while ensuring the author&#39;s integrity.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Maintaining Narrative Integrity:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Ensures the integrity of captivating narratives throughout the composition process.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Digital Evolution of Recruiting Instructors:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Democratizes access to personalized application support by digitally evolving recruiting practices.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>AI-Powered Guidance:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enhances user essays with real-time guidance and solutions using cutting-edge AI technology.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Exceptional Integration:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Seamlessly integrates into user workflows with a simple and intuitive command-line interface.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>University Partnerships:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Collaborates with universities to align student narratives with desired graduate attributes, promoting inclusivity.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Is the use of artificial intelligence in ESAI ethical?<br>Yes! It is imperative that pupils have access to resources that enable them to accomplish their objectives while upholding their integrity. The methodology we employ is an organic progression from the established convention of engaging instructors to aid in the completion of collegiate applications. By increasing the availability of such support for every student, we are not merely promoting equality; rather, we are enabling adolescents to achieve their utmost capabilities. Students have the ability to utilize state-of-the-art technology with ESAI in order to narrate their stories in a manner that is genuine, captivating, and uniquely their own.<br>In what ways can ESAI improve my college applications?<br>The widely used College Admissions Tool provides assistance to students in various aspects of their college applications, including topic selection, outlining, and revision. A fraction of the cost that a human educator could charge to automate anything.What is the relationship between ESAI and universities?<br>ESAI considers itself a collaborator in the effort of higher education institutions to increase accessibility and equity throughout the college application process and experience for every student. Instead of supplanting diligence and perseverance, our technology serves as a potent instrument to assist students in establishing significant correlations between their narratives and concepts and the attributes that esteemed institutions anticipate from their post-secondary endeavors. We are convinced that through collaboration with institutions, it is possible to establish an educational environment that is more inclusive and transformative, to the benefit of all. By implementing ESAI, universities can provide students with a novel and efficient means of demonstrating their distinct abilities and perspectives, all the while maintaining the integrity and rigor of higher education.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"This AI writing tool aids students and young professionals in crafting persuasive essays and narratives, ensuring ethical support, real-time guidance, and seamless integration, while also partnering with universities for inclusivity.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Enhances college applications, essays, and personal statements by integrating AI-powered insights into users' narratives.</li><li>Professional Development: Enables young professionals to effectively communicate their experiences, thereby enhancing the merit of their job applications and career progressions.</li><li>Equitable Access: Facilitates equal opportunity for all by surmounting socioeconomic obstacles through the provision of expert writing guidance.</li><li>Enhance your capabilities with ES.AI is an innovative platform that connects your personal narrative with your academic or professional goals.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://esai.ai/products/complete-es-ai-collection\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://esai.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/esai_toolkit/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@esai_toolkit\",\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://esai.ai/cdn/shop/files/ESAI_2024_Logos_Ink.png?v=1705614774&width=500\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 192,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.513Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.856Z\",\n      \"title\": \"SchoolHack\",\n      \"slug\": \"SchoolHack\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"writing generators\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"School Hack is an AI tool designed to provide quick and easy responses to common student queries, aiding them in better time management alongside their academic responsibilities. It includes College Express for comprehensive academic coverage and offers writing support for essay composition. \\n\\n**Features:** \\n- **Comprehensive Academic Coverage:** \\n- Encompasses all academic curricula from secondary school to university. \\n- **Essay Composition Support:** \\n- Assists students in composing essays. \\n- **Paraphrase Feature:** \\n- Helps learners avoid plagiarism and improve their writing by offering paraphrasing assistance.\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"School Hack assists students with academic queries, covering curricula from secondary school to university, and provides essay writing support with a paraphrase feature to enhance writing skills and avoid plagiarism.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": null,\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.schoolhack.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/people/SchoolHack-AI/pfbid0vKy2wrNxcy8dPAVRwh7fCtQz6JH64bPFoBWTYxD6KVsVwWUynM5LC5ZcRXgZjQwTl/\",\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/school-hack-ai\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 191,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.511Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.854Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Caktus\",\n      \"slug\": \"Caktus\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"personal assistant\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"Caktus is an educational AI application that automates academic tasks, enabling students to focus on personal pursuits while saving time. It offers various AI-powered services tailored to enhance time management and academic routines. \\n\\n**Features:** \\n- **AI-Powered Applications:** \\n- Includes Essay Writer, Paragraph Generator, and Discussion Questions. \\n- **Text Summaries and Personal Statements:** \\n- Generates text summaries and converts YouTube videos into essays. \\n- **Coding Writers:** \\n- Proficient in Go, Python, Java, C#, and Javascript. \\n- **Career Section Services:** \\n- Offers bullet point writers for resumes and cover letters. \\n- **Caktus Scholarship Program:** \\n- Designed to improve academic prospects and provide assistance.\",\n      \"faqs\": \"How is Caktus operational?<br>In conjunction with the CORE database, Caktus employs a sizable language model to produce high-quality educational outcomes. Caktus serves as an economical supplementary academic resource beyond the confines of the classroom.<br>Can I utilize Caktus in the classroom?<br>Certainly, indeed! Caktus can assist you with lecture note-taking, idea generation in class, and more! Numerous instructors have incorporated Caktus into their curricula.What distinguishes Caktus from ChatGPT?<br>Designed with students in mind, Caktus extracts scholarly sources from its proprietary database. In addition to adapting to your particular writing style, Caktus offers a variety of educational aids intended to facilitate learning.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Caktus automates academic tasks with AI-powered tools like Essay Writer and Paragraph Generator while offering career services and a scholarship program to enhance students' educational experiences.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Generate essays and paragraphs rapidly utilizing AI-generated content.</li><li>Please provide intellectually stimulating discussion prompts for use in classroom activities or assignments.</li><li>YouTube videos can be converted to essay format to facilitate analysis and citation.</li><li>By summarizing extensive texts, comprehension and retention are improved.</li><li>Enhance the quality of your resume and cover letter with writing tools powered by AI.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://caktus.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://caktus.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/caktus.ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/Caktus_ai\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@caktus.ai?lang=en\",\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://d1muf25xaso8hp.cloudfront.net/https%3A%2F%2Fe2c066d76c1f8df738d1acebc86e1802.cdn.bubble.io%2Fd147%2Ff1696267258982x396741473321420740%2FCaktus%2520logo%2520horiz%2520color%25201%2520%25281%2529.webp?w=128&h=47&auto=compress&dpr=1.25&fit=max\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 190,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.509Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.853Z\",\n      \"title\": \"OpenRead\",\n      \"slug\": \"OpenRead\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"research\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool optimizes online course development, catering to organizations, instructors, and learners, through intelligent functionalities.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Time-Efficient Course Design:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Generates preliminary course structures rapidly, reducing course development time significantly.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Capabilities for Converting Content:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Converts diverse content formats (web pages, documents, videos) into instructional materials.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Enhanced Learner Engagement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Incorporates interactive elements like videos and assessments to promote learner engagement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Adaptable Course Publication Options:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows private/public course publication, simplifies sales, and enables LMS export.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Time-Saving:</strong><ul> \\n<li>AI-powered functionalities enable course creation in under an hour.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Adaptable Content Conversion:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Converts various content formats into course materials flexibly.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Increased Learner Engagement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides interactive resources to enhance learner participation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Publication Options:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers various publication options, including sales and LMS export.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Limitation in Customization:</strong><ul> \\n<li>May lack the same level of customization as other tools.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Learning Curve:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Users may require time to adjust to the tool&#39;s functionalities.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Subscription-Based Pricing:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Pricing is subscription-based, which may not suit all users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Why do you provide unrestricted PDF parsing without any upload limits as your primary offering? Can this feature be anticipated to remain free indefinitely?<br>Our objective is to guarantee that a wide range of individuals can derive advantages from the potential for technology to substantially affect people's lives. For this reason, we have implemented this feature without any associated cost. We are dedicated to preserving its current and future state of excellence so that you may benefit from it without incurring any expenses.<br>Is it possible to modify my own Oat in the future?<br>Yes! It should be noted, however, that the current cost is quite high, rendering it viable primarily for research organizations, institutions, or the R&D departments of large corporations. However, our top priority is to actively decrease the price in order to increase the accessibility of Oat customization for a broader demographic.What distinguishes your Paper Q&A from competing products?<br>Our method consists of two essential stages. To begin, we employ specialized technology to thoroughly decompose the PDF file, thereby extracting data that is both pristine and well-organized. This guarantees that the information is presented in an accurate manner. Furthermore, the complete dataset is inputted into our sophisticated AI model without any truncation, which empowers us to produce answers that are exceptionally precise. We ensure that our results adhere to a 99.9% accuracy level using this methodology.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool streamlines online course development with time-efficient design, content conversion capabilities, enhanced learner engagement features, and adaptable publication options, albeit with limited customization and subscription-based pricing.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Educators: efficiently developing captivating online courses.</li><li>Efficient conversion of pre-existing training materials into online courses for instructors.</li><li>Effectively developing and marketing online training courses for businesses.</li><li>Electronic learning Businesses: Efficiently producing a variety of eLearning materials.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: Implemented by non-profit organizations to generate educational content; employed by independent consultants to design and sell courses.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.openread.academy/en/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.openread.academy/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/OpenRead_HQ\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/openread/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 189,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.508Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.852Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Coursebox\",\n      \"slug\": \"Coursebox\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"startup tools\",\n        \"teachers\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool optimizes online course development for organizations, instructors, and learners through automated processes.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Design of Time-Saving Courses:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Generates course structures instantly, significantly reducing course creation time.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Conversion of Content Capabilities:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Converts various content formats into course materials, including documents, web pages, and videos.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Increased Learner Participation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enhances engagement with interactive elements like assessments and videos.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Adaptable Options for Course Publication:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows courses to be published privately or publicly, sold, or exported to learning management systems.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Time-Saving:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Completes course creation in under an hour with AI-powered features.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Adaptable Content Conversion:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Converts diverse content formats into course materials with flexibility.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Increased Learner Engagement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides interactive resources to enhance learner participation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Publication Options:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers various publication options for courses, including sales and export to LMS.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Limited Customization:</strong><ul> \\n<li>May have less customization compared to other tools.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Learning Curve:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Users may require time to adjust to the tool&#39;s functionalities.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Subscription-Based Pricing:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Pricing is based on subscription, which may not suit all users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool streamlines online course development, offering time-saving features, adaptable content conversion, increased learner engagement, and various publication options, albeit with limited customization and subscription-based pricing.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/Bj6Psmg3zVQ\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Educators: efficiently developing captivating online courses.</li><li>Efficient conversion of pre-existing training materials into online courses for instructors.</li><li>Effectively developing and marketing online training courses for businesses.</li><li>Electronic learning Businesses: Efficiently producing a variety of eLearning materials.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: Implemented by non-profit organizations to generate educational content; employed by independent consultants to design and sell courses.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.coursebox.ai/plans-pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.coursebox.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/coursebox.ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/courseboxai\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/Coursebox_ai\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/courseboxai\",\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@coursebox.ai\",\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 188,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.506Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.850Z\",\n      \"title\": \"LangoTalk\",\n      \"slug\": \"LangoTalk\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"personal assistant\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool offers flexible language practice accessible anytime, anywhere, featuring realistic conversations with AI agents, translation support, and motivational incentives to encourage consistent progress.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Realistic Conversations:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Interact with AI agents simulating authentic conversations for meaningful language practice.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Translation Feature:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Expand vocabulary by translating messages to acquire new phrases and expressions.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Accomplishments and Incentives:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Stay motivated with success-based incentives that encourage ongoing learning and progress.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Efficient Registration:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Start the process in under two minutes, reducing barriers to entry and providing quick access to educational materials.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool offers realistic conversations, translation support, and motivational incentives for efficient language practice, with a quick registration process for easy access to educational materials.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Application Domains for Langotalk Language Enthusiasts: Designed to accommodate various learning styles and provide a more engaging and expedient approach to language acquisition.</li><li>Travelers: Ideal for individuals seeking to enhance their communication capabilities while on the road by learning a new language; facilitates cultural immersion.</li><li>Professionals: Appropriate for professionals seeking to increase their professional development and versatility while expanding their career prospects through the acquisition of additional languages.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.langotalk.org/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/langotalkapp/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://www.langotalk.org/logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 187,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.503Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.849Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Meshy\",\n      \"slug\": \"Meshy\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"3D\",\n        \"generative ai tools\",\n        \"design generators\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"image generators\",\n        \"art\",\n        \"productivity\",\n        \"gaming\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Meshy is an AI application revolutionizing 3D content creation, enabling users to convert text and images into detailed 3D models and textures swiftly. It targets digital artists, content creators, and game developers, aiming to streamline 3D modeling and texturing processes.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Text to 3D Conversion:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Transforms textual descriptions into intricate 3D models, catering to users without 3D expertise.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Image to 3D Conversion:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Converts 2D images into 3D models, leveraging AI&#39;s understanding of form and depth.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Texture Generation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Creates high-quality textures based on concept art or text prompts, reducing texturing time significantly.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Workflow Integration:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Seamlessly integrates with standard industry workflows for rapid performance.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Artistic Techniques:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Accommodates various artistic techniques from voxel to photorealistic, meeting diverse creative needs.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Intuitive interface facilitates navigation for users with limited 3D modeling experience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Multilingual Support:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enables input in multiple languages for enhanced accessibility.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>API Integration:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Developers can integrate Meshy&#39;s capabilities into their applications, enhancing functionality.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Export Formats:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Supports export in formats like FBX, GLB, or USDZ for compatibility with other software.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"What is Meshy's unique quality?<br>Meshy is an AI-powered 3D generative toolkit that efficiently generates 3D assets from text or images, thereby expediting the 3D workflow. In minutes, one can generate 3D models and textures of superior quality using Meshy. Meshy enables 3D artists, game developers, and creative coders to produce 3D assets at an unprecedented rate.<br>Is the asset secure?<br>Yes, data security is a top priority for us. Your information is maintained securely with Amazon Web Services in the United States if you utilize the web application. Without your consent, we will NOT share your information or use it for any training purpose.Which methods of payment do you accept?<br>All major payment methods are accepted. Additionally, prominent payment methods including Cash App Pay, Apple Pay, and Google Pay are supported. On request, wire transfers are also supported for Enterprise plans.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Meshy leverages AI to swiftly convert text and images into detailed 3D models and textures, benefiting digital artists, content creators, and game developers, with features including text-to-3D conversion, rapid workflow integration, and multilingual support.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/ueQB1fzXy-s\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Game developers employ Meshy as a tool to facilitate asset creation and rapid prototyping.</li><li>Architects and interior designers: 3D visualization of designs and concepts.</li><li>Incorporating Meshy as an instructional instrument in design and technology courses at academic institutions.</li><li>Exploring 3D modeling as a hobby without substantial investment or learning.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: Filmmakers and fashion designers utilize Meshy to create virtual product mockups and pre-visualize sets and accessories, respectively.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.meshy.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.meshy.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/meshy.ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/MeshyAI\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 186,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.500Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.848Z\",\n      \"title\": \"SummarizePaper\",\n      \"slug\": \"SummarizePaper\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"research\",\n        \"summarizer\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool provides concise summaries of research papers to aid in understanding key arguments, along with a virtual assistant capable of responding to inquiries about the paper&#39;s content.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Succinct Summaries:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Generates brief summaries of research papers to facilitate comprehension.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Virtual Assistant:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides a virtual assistant capable of answering questions related to the paper&#39;s substance.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Open-Source Framework:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Fosters innovation and collaboration among students and researchers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Efficiency Enhancement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Assists scholars and researchers in efficiently digesting research papers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Could I be restricted in the quantity of papers that I am permitted to summarize?<br>While the capacity to summarize papers is not restricted, this may be subject to modification in the event of an overflow. Utilize the platform to the fullest extent necessary to remain informed about the most recent advancements in research.<br>How do I recommend a specific paper for summarization?<br>You can search for a specific paper using the homepage's search bar, or simply enter the arXiv ID of the paper you wish to summarize and the results will include a summary and additional information. Please be advised that if this particular article is being sought for the first time, our AI code will need to execute to summarize it. This process could take up to a few minutes.How is the AI summarization implemented?<br>The AI analyzes and extracts the most vital information from the documents using sophisticated machine learning algorithms, and presents it in a condensed and comprehensible format. It employs the most recent OpenAI engines, namely GPt3, GPt3.5, and GPT4.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool offers concise research paper summaries and a virtual assistant, leveraging an open-source framework to aid scholars and researchers in efficiently understanding paper content.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Academic Consumption: Facilitates expedient reading of scholarly research papers for academic objectives.</li><li>Sustain Current Information: Assists users in remaining informed about the most recent advancements in research within particular disciplines.</li><li>Collaborative Research: Promotes the coordination and cooperation of students and researchers across a range of research endeavors.</li><li>Approved by esteemed academic sources, this AI-powered platform is regarded as a reliable solution due to its plethora of advantageous features and functions.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://summarizepaper.com/en/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://summarizepaper.com/static/summarizer/images/logo.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 185,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.498Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.847Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Mindgrasp\",\n      \"slug\": \"Mindgrasp\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"productivity\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"teachers\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool offers efficient content analysis by extracting answers from diverse sources like documents, videos, and meetings, enabling rapid note generation and precise Q&amp;A extraction.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Rapid Note Generation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Instantly generates concise notes from various sources.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Effective Q&amp;A Extraction:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Acquires responses to inquiries directly from the source material.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Versatile Source Compatibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Capable of analyzing documents, videos, meetings, and more for content extraction.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"What distinguishes Mindgrasp from other AI tools?<br>One notable distinction between Mindgrasp and alternative AI tools such as chat GPT is that Mindgrasp was purposefully developed to enhance learning efficiency and productivity. Considerable effort was devoted to ensuring that Mindgrasp could accommodate a wide variety of content uploading formats. Furthermore, great care was taken to guarantee that the accuracy and capacity of Mindgrasp to analyze and comprehend this data were unparalleled.<br>Who Should Use Mindgrasp?<br>Although Mindgrasp was initially developed to assist students in comprehending vast quantities of information more rapidly, we have discovered that a number of professionals also find it useful. Therefore, it can be concluded that Mindgrasp is suitable for individuals seeking to enhance their learning efficiency and productivity.What is Mindgrasp's operation?<br>Mindgrasp will analyze the content you upload by reading, listening, or watching it, and then generate precise responses, summaries, flashcards, and assessments; this will allow you to learn more quickly and efficiently.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool facilitates rapid and precise note generation and Q&A extraction from various sources, including documents, videos, and meetings.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Time-Saving Note Generation: Generate precise notes from videos, documents, and other sources to save time.</li><li>Enhanced Q&A Accessibility: Obtain responses to inquiries from a wide range of subjects without the need for manual perusal of the content.</li><li>Enhanced Comprehension: Utilize succinct notes to facilitate comprehension and retention of essential concepts.</li><li>Enhance your understanding and productivity with Mindgrasp, the solution of choice for generating precise notes and responses derived from an extensive array of content sources.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://mindgrasp.ai/pricing-2/\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://mindgrasp.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/mindgrasp.ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/MindgraspAI\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/mindgrasp-io\",\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@mindgrasp.ai?lang=en\",\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://i0.wp.com/mindgrasp.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Mindgrasp-Logo-main-TM.png?w=628&ssl=1\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 184,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.496Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.845Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Thinkdiffusion\",\n      \"slug\": \"Thinkdiffusion\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"image generators\",\n        \"cartoon generators\",\n        \"generative ai tools\",\n        \"art\",\n        \"video editing\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"design generators\",\n        \"fashion\",\n        \"video generators\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Thinkdiffusion is an innovative platform tailored for creative professionals like artists, designers, and filmmakers, offering a cloud-based art laboratory for AI-driven artistic creation.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>User Interface Variety:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers interfaces ranging from basic to advanced, catering to users with different expertise levels.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Model Training Capabilities:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows custom model training to meet specific creative requirements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Video and Animation Support:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides advanced tools for creating and enhancing videos using AI technology.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Community Workflows:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Access to a library of community-built workflows for efficient content creation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Cross-Device Flexibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Easily accessible across various devices, including mobile phones.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Extension Ecosystem:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers a wide range of extensions for users to install and use.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Personal Storage:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides up to 200GB of personal storage for file organization and persistence.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Cloud-based Accessibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Simplifies access without the need for expensive hardware.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>High-Speed Processing:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Speeds up content creation through rapid processing.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Model Upload and Extensions:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Users can upload custom models and utilize extensions to align with their artistic preferences.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Collaborative Environment:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Access to the latest features from open-source developers and a supportive community.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Learning Curve:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Novice users may require time to familiarize themselves with advanced functionalities.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Internet Dependency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Requires a stable internet connection for cloud-based operations.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Recurring Fees:</strong><ul> \\n<li>While free trials are available, recurring fees for advanced features may deter some users. </li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"<br>\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Thinkdiffusion offers a comprehensive platform for creative professionals, featuring diverse interfaces, model training, video support, and a collaborative environment, although recurring fees and a learning curve may pose challenges for some users.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>The intended demographic comprises filmmakers and animators who utilize AI to generate animations and improve videos.</li><li>Fashion Designers: Investigating AI design and inspiration for runway presentations.</li><li>Creative Agencies: Employing Thinkdiffusion to develop distinctive visuals for advertising campaigns.</li><li>AI is assisting illustrators and artists in bringing concepts and drawings to life.</li><li>Atypical Applications: Academic establishments incorporating AI into their creative curricula; Enthusiasts striving to produce personal artwork of a professional caliber.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.thinkdiffusion.com/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.thinkdiffusion.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/thinkdiffusion/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/thinkdiffusion\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@thinkdiffusion\",\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"art_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 183,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.495Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.844Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Essay-Builder.AI\",\n      \"slug\": \"Essay-Builder.AI\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"writing generators\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Essay Builder AI is a free tool that harnesses artificial intelligence to generate high-quality essays swiftly, benefiting students by saving time and adhering to academic standards.</p> \\n<p><strong>Positive Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Efficient Essay Composition:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Automatically generates essays after selecting the type and format, streamlining the process for students.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Powered by AI Technology:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Utilizes advanced AI algorithms to ensure the production of essays meeting exceptional quality standards.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>No Cost to Use:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Accessible to all students as the tool is provided free of charge.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Time Saving:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Rapidly produces essays, conserving students&#39; time while maintaining adherence to academic criteria.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Essay Builder AI is what?<br>Utilizing artificial intelligence, Essay Builder AI is a complimentary online application that aids students in the process of generating essays. Its purpose is to offer students a streamlined and effective method for producing coherent and well-organized essays on a wide range of subjects.<br>With Essay Builder AI, it is simple to generate free essays of the highest quality. Select the essay format and word count, and Essay Builder AI will handle the remainder!<br>How is Essay Builder AI implemented?<br>Essay Builder AI analyzes the provided topic and generates pertinent content by employing sophisticated algorithms and natural language processing. It generates a customized essay by considering the user's input, which may include keywords and the intended length of the essay. The generated content is guaranteed to be cogent, grammatically accurate, and free from plagiarism by means of the AI technology.Does Essay Builder AI accommodate students of all academic levels?<br>Essay Builder AI has been specifically developed to accommodate the needs of learners spanning all academic levels, including those enrolled in high school and universities. The application is capable of producing essays on a wide range of topics, such as literature, history, science, and more. Students requiring aid with their writing assignments will find it to be an invaluable resource.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Essay Builder AI, powered by AI technology, offers efficient essay generation at no cost, saving students' time by swiftly producing high-quality essays.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Utilizations of Essay Builder AI encompass a wide range of academic-related endeavors:</li><li>Produce outstanding essays for a variety of academic assignments and examinations.</li><li>Develop your writing abilities by analyzing the essays generated by AI.</li><li>Time and effort can be conserved by utilizing the tool to efficiently and rapidly generate essays.</li><li>Examine Essay Builder AI today for free and discover the advantages of essay creation powered by AI.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://essay-builder.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://essay-builder.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": null,\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 182,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.493Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.843Z\",\n      \"title\": \"PixAI.Art\",\n      \"slug\": \"PixAI.Art\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"art  text to image\",\n        \"fun tools\",\n        \"image to image\",\n        \"portrait generators\",\n        \"cartoon generators\",\n        \"drawing\",\n        \"generative ai tools\",\n        \"free ai tools\",\n        \"story teller\",\n        \"image editing\",\n        \"design generators\",\n        \"social media\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"image generators\",\n        \"avatars\",\n        \"prompt generators\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI-driven application is tailored for digital artists and anime enthusiasts, utilizing advanced technology to convert user input into original anime-style artwork.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Anime-Style Artwork Generation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Creates anime-style artwork from textual descriptions or base images.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Customization Options:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows users to adjust various parameters to fine-tune the generated artwork.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>High-Resolution Outputs:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Capable of producing high-quality images suitable for various digital applications.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides an intuitive platform suitable for users of all skill levels.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Enhanced Creativity:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Generates multiple artistic interpretations from a single prompt, fostering creativity.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Time Saving:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Significantly reduces the time required for developing intricate anime characters.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Cost-Effectiveness:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers AI art generation at no cost, benefiting users on a budget.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Accessibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows individuals without formal artistic training to create anime art effortlessly.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Strict Style Selection:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Primarily focuses on anime, limiting options for diverse artistic styles.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Quality Dependency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Output quality depends on the comprehensiveness of user prompts.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Potential Generic Results:</strong><ul> \\n<li>May produce artwork lacking the uniqueness of hand-drawn illustrations.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \" \",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI application caters to digital artists and anime enthusiasts, generating anime-style artwork from user input with customizable options, high-resolution outputs, and an intuitive interface, though primarily focused on anime style with some limitations in output diversity and quality dependency on user input.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>A fan of anime who creates fan art and custom avatars of their favored characters.</li><li>Producing distinctive visual content, including social media posts, videos, and other forms of digital media.</li><li>Anime-inspired character and asset design for independent video games on behalf of game developers.</li><li>Illustrators and Storytellers: Illustrating fictional personas to bolster narratives.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: Employed by educators to facilitate creative writing and art projects; utilized by event organizers to provide personalized invitations and decorations with an anime theme.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://pixai.art/membership/plans\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://pixai.art/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/pixai_official\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/PixAI_Official\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width='128'%20height='128'%20viewBox='0%200%20128%20128'%20fill='none'%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23clip0_2_3)'%3e%3cpath%20d='M0%2032C0%2020.799%200%2015.1984%202.17987%2010.9202C4.09734%207.15695%207.15695%204.09734%2010.9202%202.17987C15.1984%200%2020.799%200%2032%200H96C107.201%200%20112.802%200%20117.08%202.17987C120.843%204.09734%20123.903%207.15695%20125.82%2010.9202C128%2015.1984%20128%2020.799%20128%2032V96C128%20107.201%20128%20112.802%20125.82%20117.08C123.903%20120.843%20120.843%20123.903%20117.08%20125.82C112.802%20128%20107.201%20128%2096%20128H32C20.799%20128%2015.1984%20128%2010.9202%20125.82C7.15695%20123.903%204.09734%20120.843%202.17987%20117.08C0%20112.802%200%20107.201%200%2096V32Z'%20fill='url(%23paint0_linear_2_3)'/%3e%3cpath%20d='M36%20100.727V28H66.0426C71.4877%2028%2076.187%2029.0653%2080.1406%2031.196C84.1179%2033.303%2087.1837%2036.2505%2089.3381%2040.0383C91.4924%2043.8026%2092.5696%2048.1823%2092.5696%2053.1776C92.5696%2058.1965%2091.4687%2062.5881%2089.267%2066.3523C87.089%2070.0928%2083.9759%2072.9929%2079.9276%2075.0526C75.8793%2077.1122%2071.0734%2078.142%2065.5099%2078.142H46.973V64.2926H62.2429C64.8944%2064.2926%2067.108%2063.831%2068.8835%2062.9077C70.6828%2061.9844%2072.044%2060.6941%2072.9673%2059.0369C73.8906%2057.3561%2074.3523%2055.4029%2074.3523%2053.1776C74.3523%2050.9285%2073.8906%2048.9872%2072.9673%2047.3537C72.044%2045.6965%2070.6828%2044.4181%2068.8835%2043.5185C67.0843%2042.6188%2064.8707%2042.169%2062.2429%2042.169H53.5781V100.727H36Z'%20fill='white'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cdefs%3e%3clinearGradient%20id='paint0_linear_2_3'%20x1='64'%20y1='0'%20x2='64'%20y2='128'%20gradientUnits='userSpaceOnUse'%3e%3cstop%20stop-color='%234D4D4D'/%3e%3cstop%20offset='1'%20stop-color='%23161313'/%3e%3c/linearGradient%3e%3cclipPath%20id='clip0_2_3'%3e%3crect%20width='128'%20height='128'%20fill='white'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3c/defs%3e%3c/svg%3e\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"image_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 181,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.490Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.842Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Scholarcy\",\n      \"slug\": \"Scholarcy\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"research\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>Scholarcy is a web-based summarization tool that evaluates and determines the significance of diverse document types, such as books, articles, reports, and chapters, with efficiency.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Summaries Powered by AI:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Efficiently summarizes lengthy documents, saving users time.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Summary Flashcards:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Presents concise and organized summaries in flashcard format for easy comprehension.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Automatic Reference Extraction:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Identifies essential references within documents, aiding further research.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Browser Extension:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Seamlessly integrates with open-access repositories, enhancing accessibility and enabling users to build a searchable collection.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Could Scholarcy provide me with access to documents from my university library?<br>Not at the moment. For scholarly to provide a summary of an article, access to the article's text is required. This signifies that Scholarcy is unable to process articles that are protected by a paywall. The PDF must be downloaded and imported in order to generate a summary of these articles.<br>Can Scholarcy provide summaries for articles written in a language other than English?<br>Scholarly articles can be summarized in the majority of European languages. The original-language versions of the Highlights, Summary, Comparative Analysis, and Full Text are available.As a result of utilizing third-party APIs, the Synopsis and enhanced summary modes will be rewritten in English for Scholarcy. We advise using the Google Translate browser extension if you wish to read these sections in their original language.<br>Scholarcy is able to summarize video content.<br>Although Scholarcy has the capability to produce flashcards from videos, its primary functionality is with academic articles and book chapters. As a result, the outcomes you obtain may differ contingent on the quality of the transcription and the subject matter of the video.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Scholarcy, a web-based summarization application, efficiently evaluates and summarizes various document types, offering features such as AI-powered summaries and automatic reference extraction for enhanced research productivity.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/LIkQWx-cXuk\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Scholars: Rapidly assess the importance of articles and reports pertaining to their area of expertise.</li><li>Students may utilize condensed versions of extensive documents to save time.</li><li>Journalists must possess the ability to quickly comprehend the essential aspects of documents in order to provide precise reporting.</li><li>Librarians should aid patrons in locating pertinent information through the provision of concise summaries.</li><li>AI-driven Scholarcy is an indispensable resource that assists journalists, academics, researchers, and librarians, among others, by facilitating the efficient assimilation of information and offering time-saving functionalities.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.scholarcy.com/pricing/\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.scholarcy.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/scholarcy\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/scholarcy\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/scholarcy\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://www.scholarcy.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/scholarcy-logo.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 180,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.488Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.840Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Contents.com\",\n      \"slug\": \"Contents.com\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"copywriting\",\n        \"generative ai tools\",\n        \"text to image\",\n        \"translator\",\n        \"SEO\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"image generators\",\n        \"art\",\n        \"productivity\",\n        \"e-commerce\",\n        \"transcriber\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The Generative AI Platform is designed to revolutionize content creation processes, catering to enterprises, bloggers, marketing teams, and publishers.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>AI Writer:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Generates various types of content rapidly with AI assistance.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>AI Art:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Facilitates the creation of unique digital images.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Audio to Text/Text to Audio:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Converts text to audio and vice versa, expanding content strategies.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>AI Translation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Localizes content into over 25 languages for broader market penetration.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Professional Writing Services:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Access proficient copywriters and proofreaders for high-quality content generation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Efficiency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Streamlines content creation, saving time and effort.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Versatility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers a wide range of content creation tools.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Global Reach:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Supports translation into numerous languages for worldwide audience engagement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Professional Services:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides access to specialists for high-quality content creation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Complexity:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Extensive features may overwhelm novice users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Price Point:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Cost may be prohibitive for individual consumers or small businesses.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Restricted Integrations:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Compatibility with third-party utilities and software may be limited.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"In which languages is Contents.com available?<br>Contents.com is multilingual, supporting over 25 languages. English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, and Brazilian Portuguese are considered premium languages due to the utilization of native datasets during the AI model training process. Regarding premium languages, no additional fees apply.<br>What options does Contents.com provide?<br>Contents.com facilitates the creation of various forms of content for businesses. In addition to translations, SEO blog articles, advertising copy, e-commerce product descriptions, social media captioning, and AI images.Is the content produced through Contents.com free from plagiarism?<br>Indeed, Contents.com consistently produces novel and authentic content.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The Generative AI Platform simplifies content creation with its AI-driven tools, catering to various users, although complexity and pricing may pose challenges for some.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/4DBY9rE8fs4\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>The responsibility of marketing teams is to develop captivating content that appeals to specific target audiences.</li><li>E-commerce enterprises can increase sales by creating unique product descriptions.</li><li>Streamlining the production of diverse forms of content for publishers.</li><li>Web Agencies: Efficiently satisfying the content requirements of clients.</li><li>Bloggers: Creating blog posts that are optimized for search engines to increase audience engagement.</li><li>Large corporations: the execution of content strategies on a massive scale.</li><li>Atypical Applications: Implementation by academic establishments to instruct marketing courses. Freelance photographers who produce unique photographs.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.contents.com/pricing/\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.contents.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/contents_com/\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/contentsdotcom/\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/contentsdotcom_\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/contentsdotcom/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://www.contents.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/logo_header.svg\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 179,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.487Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.839Z\",\n      \"title\": \"TalkPal\",\n      \"slug\": \"TalkPal\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"personal assistant\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI tool aims to make language acquisition universally accessible by leveraging GPT-powered AI technology.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Personalization for Novices:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Tailored for individuals with basic language skills looking to improve.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Suitability for Various Proficiency Levels:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Appropriate for students at A2, B1, B2, C1, or C2 proficiency levels.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Enhancement of Language Proficiency:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides general language instruction and specializes in domains like conversational language, commerce, literature, and law.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Personalized Conversations:</strong><ul> \\n<li>AI facilitates personalized corrections and responses during language communication.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Gradual Improvement of Teaching Experience:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Adjusts to users&#39; interests and contexts over time, enhancing the teaching experience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"What distinguishes TalkPal from other language-learning applications?<br>TalkPal, in contrast to other language learning applications, employs cutting-edge AI to generate an engaging, enjoyable, and interactive learning environment. Active learning enables users to attain fluency with the assistance of artificial intelligence. TalkPal simulates authentic situations in which users gain knowledge through interactions with native speakers.<br><br>Which types of subscriptions does TalkPal provide?<br>TalkPal provides two subscription tiers: TalkPal Premium, which has no restrictions and more sophisticated functionalities, and a free subscription with restricted features. TalkPal Premium is available for payment on a monthly or annual basis.Do you provide educational institutions with subscription options?<br>Education institutions may, in fact, purchase subscriptions in quantity for their students through the platform we provide. Please click here for further details.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool utilizes GPT-powered technology to offer personalized language acquisition, suitable for learners at various proficiency levels, with features like tailored instruction and personalized conversations for gradual improvement.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/-WMGWaLLgsc\",\n      \"use_cases\": null,\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://app.talkpal.ai/pick-plan\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://talkpal.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/talkpal_ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": \"https://www.facebook.com/TalkPalAI/\",\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/TalkpalAI\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/talkpal/\",\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@talkpal\",\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://talkpal.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Logo_no_background.png.webp\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 178,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.486Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.838Z\",\n      \"title\": \"PromptDrive.ai\",\n      \"slug\": \"PromptDrive.ai\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"prompt generators\",\n        \"generative ai tools\",\n        \"free ai tools\",\n        \"ai chatbots\",\n        \"productivity\",\n        \"research\",\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI collaboration tool promotes adoption and teamwork by facilitating unified workspaces and streamlined workflows.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Collaboration on Prompts:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Annotate and share prompts among teams to enhance AI workflow.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Chat Collaboration:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Integrated chat execution and collaboration capabilities using ChatGPT within the platform.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Prompt Management:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Effortlessly generate, store, implement, and distribute prompts.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Sharing at the Prompt:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Facilitates prompt sharing via unique URLs for each folder.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Organization of Prompts:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Structuring prompts with adaptable options through folders and categories.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Chrome Extension:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides quick access to prompts in conjunction with Midjourney, Bard, or ChatGPT.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Support for Variables:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows the addition of variables to customize prompts.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>E