and pricing transparency.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Who Utilizes PromptDrive.ai?</li><li>Professionals in AI</li><li>Enterprise Teams</li><li>Freelancer software developers and developers</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: For educators, researchers, and others involved in the management and instruction of AI prompts.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://promptdrive.ai/#pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": null,\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/promptdrive\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/promptdrive/\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 177,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.484Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.837Z\",\n      \"title\": \"CourseFactory AI\",\n      \"slug\": \"CourseFactory-AI\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"productivity\",\n        \"design generators\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"generative ai tools\",\n        \"translator\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>CourseFactory AI is an innovative tool revolutionizing online course development, leveraging AI to streamline operations and enhance course quality for educators and trainers.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>AI-Driven Course Development:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Utilizes sophisticated AI algorithms to create course curricula aligned with educational objectives.</li> \\n</ul> \\