ll,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 171,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.476Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.829Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Teach Anything\",\n      \"slug\": \"Teach-Anything\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The tool enables efficient question answering across various subjects, allowing users to input inquiries, select language preferences, and specify difficulty levels for tailored responses.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Efficient Question Answering:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enables users to promptly find responses to inquiries on any subject matter.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Customized Inquiry Inputs:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Users can input inquiries, choose language preferences, and set difficulty levels.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Tailored Responses:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides responses tailored to the user&#39;s input, ensuring accuracy and relevance.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \" \",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The tool efficiently answers user inquiries across subjects, allowing customization of inputs and delivering tailored responses for accuracy and relevance.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/wO_3FZjtAxI\",\n      \"use_cases\": null,\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://www.buymeacoffee.com/lvwzhen/membership\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.teach-anything.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet/?text=Teach%20Anything&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.teach-anything.com\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 170,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.475Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.827Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Quriosity\",\n      \"slug\": \"Quriosity\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"video generators\",\n        \"teachers\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The tool utilizes advanced AI technology to swiftly generate customized courses tailored to individual preferences, covering a broad spectrum of topics, all accessible at no cost.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Personalized Learning Experience:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Courses are tailored to individual interests and needs, ensuring a personalized learning journey.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Extreme Variety of Topics:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers a wide array of subjects, including business, technology, and more, catering to diverse interests.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Interface:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Utilizes an intuitive interface where the AI algorithm processes text input to generate courses seamlessly.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>No Cost Access:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides complimentary access to a vast selection of courses without any restrictions, allowing users to indulge their intellectual curiosity freely.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \" \",\n      \"pricing\": \"free\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"Using advanced AI technology, the tool swiftly generates personalized courses covering various topics, offering a user-friendly experience and complimentary access.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Acquire expertise in particular domains or delve into uncharted territories.</li><li>Develop one's professional expertise or initiate an endeavor toward self-improvement.</li><li>Distribute personalized courses with ease among acquaintances, relatives, or coworkers.</li><li>Explore a realm of boundless learning opportunities, all tailored to personal interests and conveniently accessible, by harnessing the power of curiosity.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.quriosity.world/#/explore\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/quriosityworld/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/i/flow/login?redirect_after_login=%2Fquriosityworld\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/quriosityworld\",\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": true,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 169,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.473Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.826Z\",\n      \"title\": \"AI Experiments\",\n      \"slug\": \"AI-Experiments\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"generative ai tools\",\n        \"free ai tools\",\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The platform serves as a showcase for interactive AI projects, offering a space for enthusiasts and developers to explore various facets of artificial intelligence.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Interactive AI Projects:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides a variety of AI-powered initiatives for direct user engagement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Generative Tools:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Includes instruments like ImageFX and MusicFX, generating content based on user input.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Educational Collaborations:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Develops AI and computing educational content, often in collaboration with experts like NYU Professor Daniel Shiffman.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Integration with Google Services:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Certain initiatives integrate with Google services to enhance functionality.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Open-Source Contribution:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Encourages users to contribute to the community by submitting their own AI experiments.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Innovative Learning Experience:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers a captivating platform for practical AI application and learning.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>AI-powered Creative Exploration:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Empowers users to create music, images, and narratives, fostering innovation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Accessibility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enables a broad user base, including non-technical users, to comprehend and implement complex AI technologies.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Community Engagement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Facilitates a cooperative atmosphere for exchanging and exploring AI advancements.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Specialized Experiments:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Some experiments may be too specialized for a broader audience.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Strict Documentation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Lack of exhaustive documentation for inexperienced users due to experiments&#39; open-ended design.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Technical Prerequisites:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Certain experiments may require a higher level of technical understanding for complete utilization.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \" \",\n      \"pricing\": \"free\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The platform offers interactive AI projects, generative tools, educational collaborations, Google service integration, and open-source contributions, fostering innovation and learning, though some experiments may require technical expertise.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>AI experiments are utilized by educators and students to enrich STEM learning experiences.</li><li>Musicians and artists are conducting AI experiments to produce artistic works.</li><li>Technologists and developers are investigating the most recent AI applications and technologies.</li><li>Scholars: Employing the platform to investigate the way in which humans interact with AI systems.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: implemented by enthusiasts to generate personalized smart home scripts; utilized by psychologists to examine the effects of AI on creativity.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://labs.google/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/labsdotgoogle\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"misc_ai_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": true,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 168,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.472Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.825Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Quizgecko\",\n      \"slug\": \"Quizgecko\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"social media\",\n        \"teachers\",\n        \"productivity\",\n        \"spreadsheets\",\n        \"generative ai tools\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The AI Question Generator automates the creation of quizzes and exams based on text input, saving significant time and effort for educators and trainers.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>One-Click Sharing and Exporting:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Exams can be shared, exported, and embedded with ease to Excel and over nine Learning Management System (LMS) platforms.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Reporting &amp; Analytics:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides comprehensive reports and analytics for performance evaluation and auto-grading.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Chrome Extension:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows for rapid exam generation from any website through a Chrome extension.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Flashcards:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enhances study materials by converting notes into digital flashcards automatically.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Time-Saving:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Significantly reduces the time required for quiz and exam creation.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Streamlined Exporting and Sharing:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Simplifies the process of exporting exams to various platforms.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Detailed Analytics:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers comprehensive insights into performance and areas for improvement.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Versatility:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Chrome extension enables exam generation from any webpage, adding flexibility.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Limited Question Formats:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Current formats include only brief answer essays, matching, multiple-choice, true/'false, and fill-in-the-blank questions, potentially limiting options for complex question types.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Free Usage Restrictions:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Free usage is limited to three quizzes per month, which may be insufficient for heavy users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"How is Quizgecko implemented?<br>The AI-driven question and answer generator of Quizgecko operates by extracting and analyzing the essential information from any given text. The same artificial intelligence that drives ChatGPT is then employed to generate a variety of queries and answers.<br>Quizgecko can convert any type of digital file—from PDFs and Word documents to YouTube videos, educational content, webpages, and even Word documents—into quizzes and assessments.<br>Simply enter the text or URL/link to the content you wish to convert into a quiz to begin. After analyzing the text, Quizgecko will generate pertinent queries on your behalf.<br>Visit our features page to learn more about how Quizgecko's AI operates and how it can be of service to you.<br>How might I increase the standard of my results?<br>While almost any text will suffice, it is generally more effective to select factual material rather than opinions, discussions, or narratives when constructing questions. If you observe that the AI generates incorrect responses frequently, this is usually due to the suboptimal quality of the text.May I incorporate multimedia or images into my quizzes?<br>Undoubtedly, images and multimedia can be incorporated into questionnaires created on Quizgecko.<br>You are able to incorporate images into Quizgecko, either as cover images or as individual queries.<br><br>This means that you can use visuals to enhance your quizzes and engage your audience by posing questions about them.\",\n      \"pricing\": \"Paid\",\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI Question Generator automates quiz and exam creation, featuring one-click sharing, comprehensive reporting, a Chrome extension for quick generation, and flashcard enhancement, though it offers limited question formats and imposes usage restrictions for free users.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Educators: Developing examinations, exercises, and assessments for pupils.</li><li>Producing personalized study materials and flashcards for students.</li><li>Organizations: Conducting trainings, creating courses, or obtaining certifications.</li><li>Developers: Creating custom integrations using the tool's API.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: Content creators incorporating it into their YouTube videos to generate interactive surveys.</li><li>Bloggers captivate their readers by incorporating quizzes into their posts.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://quizgecko.com/\",\n      \"instagram\": null,\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/Quizgecko\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": null,\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"productivity_tools\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": true,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": false,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 167,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.470Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.824Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Textero\",\n      \"slug\": \"Textero\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"writing generators\",\n        \"education\",\n        \"story teller\",\n        \"students\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The described AI tool helps writers overcome writer&#39;s block by providing AI-powered assistance in essay outlining, citation sourcing, and idea generation.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>AI-Powered Text Generation:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Generates content with remarkable precision.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Tutorials:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Guides users seamlessly through the process.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Proficient Citation and Sourcing Tools:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Assists in academic writing with citation and sourcing.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Integrated AI Chat:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers immediate assistance to users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Flexible Document Management:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Efficiently manages documents with prominent functionalities.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Positives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Prefilled Document Ideas:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Streamlines the beginning of writing tasks.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Interactive Tutorials:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Simplifies the learning process for users.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Time-Saving Citation Styles:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Offers a drop-down menu for academic writers.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Efficient Source Location:</strong><ul> \\n<li>AI efficiently locates sources, saving time.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Elegant Interface Design:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Caters to writers of all skill levels with its elegant design.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n<p><strong>Negatives:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Limited Citation Formats:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Currently supports only MLA and APA citation formats.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>User Restrictions for Free Users:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Free users face document storage and word count restrictions. </li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"What is the potential of an AI essay writer?<br>Our application enables users to produce a wide range of scholarly essays and research papers with mere mouse strokes. Textero AI is also capable of generating comprehensive outlines with a specified number of logical components in accordance with given instructions. You may also upload a PDF or input your text in order to rapidly generate exhaustive summaries.<br>By what means does the AI Essay Writer guarantee adherence to scholarly formatting conventions?<br>Currently, students can generate MLA and APA citations using our AI essay writer tool. The style that the user specifies will be adhered to by the essay writer when formatting the generated essay. Users can achieve time savings and guarantee adherence to academic standards in this manner. In addition, sources cited in essays are formatted appropriately.Do my information and data remain secure with Textero.ai?<br>Your payment and personal information are safeguarded by means of sophisticated encryption technology. Encryption, secure storage, and routine security audits assure the safety of every manuscript that you produce.\",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"This AI tool assists writers in overcoming writer's block by providing AI-powered assistance in essay outlining, citation sourcing, and idea generation, offering seamless tutorials and efficient document management features.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": null,\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Perfect for academic research and creative writing by novelists and students.</li><li>Academic Writers: An invaluable resource for the composition of scholarly essays.</li><li>Scholars should value structured and referenced information.</li><li>Beneficial for Individuals Struggling with Writer's Block: An indispensable tool for surmounting creative obstacles.</li><li>Atypical Applications: Legal firms to draft persuasive legal documents; creative agencies to develop innovative campaign concepts.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": \"https://app.textero.ai/pricing\",\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://textero.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/texteroai/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/texteroai\",\n      \"linkedin\": \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/textero-ai/\",\n      \"tiktok\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@textero.ai\",\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://textero.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/TEXTERO-LOGO-TEXT.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\": [\n        \"text_generators\"\n      ],\n      \"featured\": false,\n      \"verified\": false,\n      \"popular\": false,\n      \"publish\": true,\n      \"editor_choice\": true,\n      \"large_image\": null,\n      \"logo\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 166,\n      \"user_created\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_created\": \"2024-06-27T07:29:09.468Z\",\n      \"user_updated\": \"9bbcca8b-5fe5-4ac4-a596-ca7172520871\",\n      \"date_updated\": \"2024-06-28T05:00:40.823Z\",\n      \"title\": \"Soofy\",\n      \"slug\": \"Soofy\",\n      \"visible_tags\": [\n        \"education\",\n        \"personal assistant\"\n      ],\n      \"long_description\": \"<p>The described AI tool offers an innovative approach to language learning, focusing on real-world scenarios and practice to enhance proficiency in foreign languages.</p> \\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p> \\n<ul> \\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Skill Enhancement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Enhances conversational, written, and pronunciation skills.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>AI-Assisted Engagement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Supports users in tasks like essay writing, image description, debate creation, and role-playing.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Effective Communication Practice:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Helps users improve daily conversational abilities and discuss books, debates, and ideas.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Vocabulary Expansion:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Promotes effortless acquisition of frequently used words and expressions.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Translation and Definitions:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Provides translations, definitions, and examples in the user&#39;s native language.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Advanced AI Feedback:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Allows users to compose examples and offers immediate feedback.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>Writing Enhancement:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Improves writing abilities through essay writing and image description tasks.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n<li><strong>AI Writing Assistance:</strong><ul> \\n<li>Assists with various writing requirements such as composing emails, articles, and generating ideas.</li> \\n</ul> \\n</li> \\n</ul> \\n\",\n      \"faqs\": \"Which languages is Soofy capable of supporting?<br>English, French, Spanish, German, Portuguese, Italian, Russian, Japanese, Chinese, Turkish, and Dutch are among the eleven languages supported by Soofy.<br>What are the reasons for selecting Soofy as opposed to alternative options?<br>When compared to alternative language learning applications, Soofy offers notable benefits. Nothing else in the world has ever utilized artificial intelligence to assist students in practicing their language abilities as Soofy does. Alternative applications, including Babbel and Duolingo, are constrained to offering pre-designed courses and prioritize the financial savings of the user. It is impossible to restrict how you can utilize the Soofy app.Can any public figure be cloned in order to communicate with it?<br>Public figures may only be cloned under the condition that you possess a legally binding agreement to do so with living individuals or deceased figures.\",\n      \