s:</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Beta Phase Limitations:</strong><ul>\\n<li>Some functionalities may still be under development, affecting overall stability.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li><strong>Learning Curve:</strong><ul>\\n<li>Novice users may require time to acclimate to the AI-centric game development approach.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li><strong>Hardware Requirements:</strong><ul>\\n<li>High-quality asset production and game development may demand powerful hardware resources.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\",\n      \"faqs\": \" \",\n      \"pricing\": null,\n      \"embed_description\": null,\n      \"short_description\": \"The AI tool streamlines game development through text-to-code conversion and asset creation collaboration, though users may face learning curves and hardware demands.\",\n      \"coupon_code\": null,\n      \"youtube_url\": \"https://youtu.be/h99H3FefxU0\",\n      \"use_cases\": \"<ul><li>Independent Game Developers: Leveraging the platform to accelerate the process of developing games.</li><li>The conversion of narratives into interactive gaming experiences by creative writers.</li><li>Curriculum integration of Rosebud to instruct game design and AI technology.</li><li>Investigating uncharted territories in the realm of digital art via interactive game environments.</li><li>Unusual Use Cases: Individuals engaged in personal gaming for exclusive gatherings.</li><li>Streamers who produce original material for their channels.</li></ul>\",\n      \"pricing_url\": null,\n      \"tool_url\": \"https://www.rosebud.ai/\",\n      \"instagram\": \"https://www.instagram.com/rosebud_ai/\",\n      \"facebook\": null,\n      \"x\": \"https://twitter.com/Rosebud_AI\",\n      \"linkedin\": null,\n      \"tiktok\": null,\n      \"logo_url\": \"https://assets-global.website-files.com/63a4b4e8266aecd424fecc5f/64caf28aaf76911cd1ede0dc_White_1000Xlogo_withText_Horizontal-p-500.png\",\n      \"function\": [\n        \"education\"\n      ],\n      \"categories\"